            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"status\":\"success\",\"data\":{\"status\":200,\"pageType\":\"iulp\",\"listingType\":\"university\",\"admissionData\":{\"admissionDetails\":\"<p><strong>IIT Bombay admissions 2027 </strong>updates are given below:</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>GATE 2027 city allotment notification for ME/MTech and Phd admission will be announced on <strong>Jan 4, 2027</strong>. Its exam will be held from <strong>Feb 6 to Feb 7, 2027</strong>; <strong>Feb 13 to Feb 14, 2027</strong>; and <strong>Feb 20 to Feb 21, 2027</strong>.</li>\\n<li>IIT JAM 2027 registration process for MSc course admission has concluded. The exam will be conducted on&nbsp;<strong>Feb 14, 2027</strong>.</li>\\n<li>JEE Main 2027 session 1 online application form is now available on the official website for admission to the BTech, BArch and BPlan courses till <strong>Nov 22, 2026</strong>. The exam will be held on <strong>Jan 22, 2027</strong> to <strong>Jan 24, 2027</strong> and <strong>Jan 28, 2027</strong> to <strong>Jan 30, 2027</strong> respectively.</li>\\n<li>CEED 2027 online registration for admission with regular fee will be ongoing till <strong>Nov 5, 2026</strong>. Further exam will be conducted in offline mode on <strong>Jan 17, 2027</strong>.</li>\\n<li>UCEED 2027 exam will be held on <strong>Jan 17, 2027</strong>.</li>\\n</ul>\",\"showAdmissionFlag\":true,\"admissionPostedDate\":\"Nov 23, 2026\",\"url\":\"/university/iit-bombay-indian-institute-of-technology-mumbai-54212/admission\",\"pdfUrl\":null,\"examList\":[{\"name\":\"COAP\",\"url\":\"/engineering/coap-counselling\",\"fullName\":\"Common Offer Acceptance Portal (COAP)\",\"year\":2026}]},\"cpAndADPinterlinkingWidget\":{\"popular\":[{\"id\":19985,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/iit-courses-blogId-19985\",\"title\":\"List of Courses offered by IITs in India 2026: Check Full List of Courses in All IITs\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1568351606phpkOq070_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"Check out the list of courses offered by IIT along with their admissions and eligibility criteria. Also take a look at some of the unique as well as popular IIT courses. Read to know about the types of courses offered at IIT, the most sought-after specialisations, niche courses, admission and eligibility and cut-offs required to study.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-09-08 17:57:23\",\"views\":742373,\"userId\":29781649,\"comments\":12,\"shares\":83,\"discussionTopicId\":5226543,\"tagType\":\"multi\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":29439,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/gate-marks-vs-rank-blogId-29439\",\"title\":\"GATE Marks vs Rank 2026: Branch-Wise Cutoff OUT, Safe Score, Previous Year's Trends\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1771402450phpp90IGA_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"LCandidates can check detailed GATE 2026 marks vs rank analysis below. For CSE, 85-100 marks is required to get AIR under 10. Check GATE 2026 branch-wise expected marks vs rank analysis, good GATE rank, CS cutoff vs marks, cutoff details and predict your AIR here.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-11-18 17:10:55\",\"views\":478892,\"userId\":2582250,\"comments\":37,\"shares\":123,\"discussionTopicId\":5867375,\"tagType\":\"exam\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":32047,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/iit-placements-know-highest-salary-package-placement-process-blogId-32047\",\"title\":\"IIT Placements 2026: Know Highest Salary Package & Placement Process\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1791376338phpGgA51a_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"Know the highest salary packages and the complete placement procedure of IITs here. The engineering graduates from IITs are placed in the top companies with high salaries. The article gives an idea of the highest salaries provided by the companies. Check this page to know about the salary packages offered to IIT graduates.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-10-07 17:56:07\",\"views\":468594,\"userId\":29781649,\"comments\":1,\"shares\":133,\"discussionTopicId\":5909895,\"tagType\":\"exam\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":37749,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/gate-syllabus-for-electronics-communication-engineering-ece-blogId-37749\",\"title\":\"GATE ECE Syllabus 2027: Electronics & Communication Revised PDF, Subject-Wise Weightage\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1780912434phpKRtkHG_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"GATE 2027 ECE Syllabus: IIT Madras have released GATE ECE. 90% of the syllabus remains the same. However, some topics have been modified. Such as  \\\"FIR and IIR filter design\\\" has been added. The topic \\\"discrete-time processing of continuous-time signals\\\" has been removed.  \\\"Correlation and regression analysis\\\" has been newly added. Read here/\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-10-07 14:39:36\",\"views\":271911,\"userId\":2582250,\"comments\":2,\"shares\":54,\"discussionTopicId\":6002113,\"tagType\":\"exam\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":24059,\"url\":\"/science/articles/iit-jam-eligibility-criteria-blogId-24059\",\"title\":\"IIT JAM Eligibility Criteria 2027 (OUT): Know Educational Qualification and Age limit\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1768309327phpcKaSHo_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"Interested in pursuing a master's degree/MSc from IIT and NITs? Candidates need to appear in the IIT JAM 2027 examination to get admission to eight MSc degree programmes at IIT and NITs. Know the minimum educational qualification and IIT JAM 2027 age limit criteria that candidates need to meet as part of IIT JAM eligibility criteria 2027.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-10-16 16:58:10\",\"views\":165700,\"userId\":61302717,\"comments\":52,\"shares\":3,\"discussionTopicId\":5771637,\"tagType\":