ages/articles/1703677258phpfb4VCX_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"Computer Science and Engineering (CSE) at IIT Bombay is the most preferred course of JEE Advanced toppers. Around 70% of the top 100 JEE Advanced candidates opt to take admission in IIT Bombay every year. Thus, the competition is stiff, and the aspirants must know what is the minimum marks and JEE Advanced for CSE.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-10-12 18:28:16\",\"views\":35483,\"userId\":29781649,\"comments\":0,\"shares\":23,\"discussionTopicId\":8985503,\"tagType\":\"institute\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":241569,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/iits-nirf-ranking-2026-blogId-241569\",\"title\":\"IITs NIRF Ranking 2026: Top IITs in India, Old vs New IIT Comparison, Ranking Parametres and Weightage\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1789131863phpIZ2fow_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"Candidates will be provided here the complete list of IITs NIRF ranking 2026 once NIRF engineering ranking 2026 list is published. Until NIRF 2026 ranking is released, candidates can check here past year IIT NIRF ranking and parameters of ranking. Also check Old IITs vs New IITs NIRF comparison.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-11-11 12:11:54\",\"views\":18492,\"userId\":29781649,\"comments\":0,\"shares\":1,\"discussionTopicId\":12991535,\"tagType\":\"exam\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":221876,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/gate-qualifying-marks-blogId-221876\",\"title\":\"GATE Qualifying Marks 2027: Expected Cutoff Predictions, Past Year's Passing Marks Trends\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1790158371phpSKsSiP_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"IIT Madras will release GATE 2027 qualifying marks for all 30 subjects. Candidates preparing for GATE 2027 exam can check expected GATE cutoff marks, passing marks for CSE, GATE minimum qualifying mark for IITs, IISc, NITs, et