he date sheet was released on November 13. ISC exam 2027 will be conducted from . was released in PDF form. We have also provided the direct link to download the date she\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-11-10 16:58:08\",\"views\":66458,\"userId\":11614203,\"comments\":0,\"shares\":59,\"discussionTopicId\":-1,\"tagType\":null,\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null}],\"latest\":[{\"id\":0,\"url\":\"/university/iit-bombay-indian-institute-of-technology-mumbai-54212/cutoff\",\"title\":\"IIT Bombay Cutoff 2026: Check JEE Advanced Round Wise Closing Ranks\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/1605086820phpSFQlAR.jpg\",\"summary\":\"IIT Bombay cutoff 2026 is available on this page for admission to the BTech, MSc, MTech, and other courses. The cutoff was released based on candidates' performance in several national-level accepting exams, including JEE Advanced, IIT JAM, GATE, etc. Further updates are below: IIT JAM 2027 registra\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-11-25 10:51:00\",\"views\":87295,\"userId\":78007874,\"comments\":0,\"shares\":17,\"discussionTopicId\":-1,\"tagType\":\"cutoff_info\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":19515,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/jee-main-exam-centres-blogId-19515\",\"title\":\"JEE Main 2027 Exam Centre (OUT): New & Removed Centres & State-Wise List\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1788955612php37XE5e_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"The complete list of states and cities where JEE Main 2027 exam will be held hs been updated by NTA with the information brochure at jeemain.nta.nic.in. Students applying for JEE Mains 2027, must check the list of centres carefully. Last year the list had 323 entries (308 in India, 15 abroad) and the 2027 list has 310 cities.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-11-25 10:46:49\",\"views\":494236,\"userId\":34019423,\"comments\":10,\"shares\":45,\"discussionTopicId\":5101397,\"tagTyp