\",\"altText\":\"IIT Kanpur Others(1)\",\"uploadedDate\":\"2017-06-07T23:20:45\"},{\"mediaId\":21719,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/v/Yq-vTT-fHtk\",\"mediaTitle\":\"About IIT Kanpur\",\"thumbUrl\":\"https://i1.ytimg.com/vi/Yq-vTT-fHtk/0.jpg\",\"altText\":\"IIT Kanpur Others(2)\",\"uploadedDate\":\"2017-06-07T23:20:45\"},{\"mediaId\":21720,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/v/m8m14Fa_OkQ\",\"mediaTitle\":\"Documentary on IIT Kanpur\",\"thumbUrl\":\"https://i1.ytimg.com/vi/m8m14Fa_OkQ/0.jpg\",\"altText\":\"IIT Kanpur Others(3)\",\"uploadedDate\":\"2017-06-07T23:20:45\"},{\"mediaId\":21721,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/v/FEvuCvcN1bI\",\"mediaTitle\":\"Overview of IIT Kanpur\",\"thumbUrl\":\"https://i1.ytimg.com/vi/FEvuCvcN1bI/0.jpg\",\"altText\":\"IIT Kanpur Others(4)\",\"uploadedDate\":\"2017-06-07T23:20:45\"},{\"mediaId\":57376,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/v/EwfhOQlheV8\",\"mediaTitle\":\"JUGNU - Nano Satellite by IIITK\",\"thumbUrl\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EwfhOQlheV8/default.jpg\",\"altText\":\"IIT Kanpur Others(5)\",\"uploadedDate\":\"2017-09-05T12:10:14\"}],\"photoSections\":[\"Campus View\",\"Cafeteria / Mess\",\"Academic Block\",\"Hostel Building\",\"Playground\",\"Auditorium\",\"Campus Building\",\"Classroom\",\"Labs\",\"Lecture Hall\",\"Library\",\"Night View\",\"Seminar hall\",\"Others\"]},\"highlightsInfo\":{\"highlights\":[{\"description\":\"IIT Kanpur has ranked 4th in the NIRF Rankings 2021 in the Engineering category\",\"description_type\":\"usp\",\"posted_on\":\"2026-07-09 13:56:16\",\"updated_on\":\"2026-07-17 12:44:07\",\"description_tag\":298},{\"description\":\"The institute has signed MoUs with multiple institutes from around the world for Academic & Research purposes\",\"description_type\":\"usp\",\"posted_on\":\"2026-07-09 13:56:16\",\"updated_on\":\"2026-07-17 12:44:07\",\"description_tag\":298}],\"allHighlightsPageUrl\":null},\"facilityInfo\":[{\"facilityId\":1,\"facilityName\":\"Library\",\"otherFacilities\":n