nology-25116/courses\",\"menuSelected\":false,\"pwa\":true,\"headingSuffix\":\"Courses 2027\",\"headingPrefix\":null,\"altText\":\"IIT Kanpur Courses\"},{\"name\":\"Fees\",\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/fees\",\"menuSelected\":false,\"pwa\":true,\"headingSuffix\":\"Fees 2027\",\"headingPrefix\":null,\"altText\":\"IIT Kanpur Fees\"},{\"name\":\"Reviews\",\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/reviews\",\"menuSelected\":false,\"pwa\":true,\"headingSuffix\":\"Reviews on Placements, Faculty & Facilities\",\"headingPrefix\":null,\"altText\":\"IIT Kanpur Reviews\"},{\"name\":\"Admissions\",\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/admission\",\"menuSelected\":false,\"pwa\":true,\"headingSuffix\":\"Admission 2027 - Cutoffs, Eligibility & Dates\",\"headingPrefix\":null,\"altText\":\"IIT Kanpur Admissions 2027\"},{\"name\":\"Placements\",\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/placement\",\"menuSelected\":false,\"pwa\":true,\"headingSuffix\":\"Placement - Highest & Average Salary Package\",\"headingPrefix\":null,\"altText\":\"IIT Kanpur Placements 2027\"},{\"name\":\"Cut-Offs\",\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/cutoff\",\"menuSelected\":false,\"pwa\":true,\"headingSuffix\":\"Cut off & Merit List 2027\",\"headingPrefix\":null,\"altText\":\"IIT Kanpur Cut Offs\"},{\"name\":\"Rankings\",\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/ranking\",\"menuSelected\":false,\"pwa\":true,\"headingSuffix\":null,\"headingPrefix\":null,\"altText\":\"IIT Kanpur Rankings\"},{\"name\":\"Gallery\",\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/gallery\",\"menuSelected\":false,\"pwa\":true,\"headingSuffix\":\"Gallery 2027\",\"headingPrefix\":null,\"altText\":\"IIT Kanpur Gallery\"},{\"name\":\"Infrastructure\",\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/infrastructure\",\"menuSelected\":false,\"pwa\":true,\"headingSuffix\":\"Infrastructure Details & Reviews\",\"headingPrefix\":null,\"altText\":\"IIT Kanpur Infrastructure\"},{\"name\":\"Faculty\",\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/faculty\",\"menuSelected\":false,\"pwa\":true,\"headingSuffix\":null,\"headingPrefix\":\"Faculty Details & Reviews\",\"altText\":\"IIT Kanpur Faculty\"},{\"name\":\"Compare\",\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/compare\",\"menuSelected\":false,\"pwa\":true,\"headingSuffix\":null,\"headingPrefix\":\"Compare\",\"altText\":\"Compare IIT Kanpur\"},{\"name\":\"Q&A\",\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/questions\",\"menuSelected\":false,\"pwa\":true,\"headingSuffix\":null,\"headingPrefix\":null,\"altText\":\"IIT Kanpur Q&A\"},{\"name\":\"Scholarships\",\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/scholarships\",\"menuSelected\":false,\"pwa\":true,\"headingSuffix\":\"Scholarships\",\"headingPrefix\":null,\"altText\":\"IIT Kanpur Scholarships\"},{\"name\":\"JEE Advanced\",\"url\":\"/engineering/jee-advanced-exam\",\"menuSelected\":false,\"pwa\":true,\"headingSuffix\":null,\"headingPrefix\":null,\"altText\":\"JEE Advanced\"}],\"breadCrumb\":[{\"name\":\"Home\",\"url\":\"/\",\"linkText\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"entityType\":null,\"pwa\":true},{\"name\":\"Colleges in Kanpur\",\"url\":\"/colleges/kanpur\",\"linkText\":null,\"entityId\":122,\"entityType\":\"city\",\"pwa\":true},{\"name\":\"IIT Kanpur\",\"url\":null,\"linkText\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"entityType\":null,\"pwa\":true}],\"faq\":{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How is the placement scenario at IIT Kanpur?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The institute has not released the placement report incorporating the overall data for the 2026 drive. However, the institute have disclosed the 2026 placement statistics till Phase I. As per the reports, over 250 recruiters participated and presented 1202 offers to the students. 1079 students were placed, of which 15 students have got international placements.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is IIT Kanpur good for MBA?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"IIT Kanpur offers MBA via Department of Management Sciences (DoMS). The MBA course of the institute has been ranked by various agencies. Under the 'Management Category', NIRF ranked IIT Kanpur at 23rd position in 2023 rankings. Business Today also ranked IIT Kanpur at 32 position. Talking about placements, IIT Kanpur highest package recorded for MBA was INR 24 LPA. The median CTC was INR 17.25 LPA. In Summer Placement (2022-24), the highest stipend offered to students was INR 17.01 lakh whereas, median stipend was INR 1 lakh.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which are the top companies visiting IIT Kanpur for M.Tech placements?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"As per the verified students' reviews on Shiksha, top companies, such as Barclays, Flipkart, Qualcomm, Bajaj, HSBC, Tata Motors and Intel come for final placements at IIT Kanpur for MTech. Students get roles from technical research profiles to analytical roles. Additionaly, the institute in 2022 recorded a the highest domestic package of INR 1.9 crore per annum (not just for M.Tech but overall across courses).\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is IIT Kanpur good for placement?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"As of now, the institute has released the phase-I placement statistics. A total of 1079 students were placed and 1202 job offers were distributed among them. Check the complete insights of IIT Kanpur placements 2026 from the table below: Particulars Placement Statistics (2026) Phase I Total job offers 1202 Students placed 1079 International offers 15 Top Recruiters Accenture, American Express, BlackRock, Boeing, Databricks\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does IIT Kanpur offer hostel facilities to its students?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, IIT Kanpur offer the most spacious hostels and the largest rooms for the students along with 22 hours of eating facilities available in the campus ranging from some well-known food chains to hostel canteens which are well-stocked. Every hostel has a basketball court, few badminton courts, a volleyball court, table tennis room, a television room, a computer room, a reading room for newspaper, magazines, journals, etc., and a hall office to handle hostel affairs.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the fee for the BSc programme at IIT Kanpur?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The total fee for the four-year BS programme of IIT Kanpur is INR 8 lakh. This is inclusive of the one-time admission and caution deposits but is not inclusive of the hostel fee. However, this fee is sourced from unofficial sources. Hence, is indicative. For the exact fee, students can reach out to the admission office. Other than this, students are required to pay the JEE Main application fee which is INR 625 (for boys) and INR 325 (for girls). For JEE Advanced, the application fee ranges from INR 1,400 to INR 2,800 for different category students.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is the BSc degree from IIT Kanpur worth it?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The best way to understand whether a college is worth picking for any course is by taking the reviews of the college and course from current or past students. The below list highlights the review of BSc course offered by IIT Kanpur. These reviews are fetched from multiple verified students' reviews available on Shiksha for BSc at IIT Kanpur. Check what students have to say in the below pointers: Almost 95% of students get placed every year in our college. Students get placed with the average salary package of 20 LPA. IIT Kanpur is a very good college for research Companies such as Intel, American Express, Jio, Qualcomm and JP Morgan visit the college for placements Top roles offered here include Software Developer, Business Analyst, Management Consultant, etc. There is unlimited Wi-Fi availability with a speed of around 100 Mbps. The classrooms are excellent. They can accommodate 50 to 600 students. It has the best teachers in our country. They are highly qualified The professors are highly qualified and supportive. They are always ready to help you in academics. To read more BSc reviews for IIT Kanpur, check out this link.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which exam do I need to write to pursue BS from IIT Kanpur?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Candidates seeking admission to BS at IIT Kanpur must have a valid score in JEE Main, JEE Advanced and go through JoSAA counselling for final admission. Admission is completely entrance exam-based and candidates seeking admission can not get into IIT Kanpur with only the scores of JEE Main. JEE Advanced followed by JoSAA counselling is the mandatory requirement. Additionally, to be eligible for the BSc programme, students are required to have passed their Class 12 with at least 75% aggregate with Science subjects (i.e., Physics, Chemistry and Mathematics).\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How is BTech in CSE at IIT Kanpur?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"BTech CSE is the most sought after BTech specialisation at IIT Kanpur. The course is offered in full-time mode for a span of 4 years. BTech CSE students at IITK have bagged excellent placement packages over the years. In 2024, the vaerage package for BTech CSE stood at INR 52.8 LPA. Further, the course curriculum offers a strong foundation in Science and maths in the first 2 years, followed by highly advanced professional courses and electives in the last 2 years of the course. It is also the most competitve BTech branch with a closing cutoff rank of 271 in 2025.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why choose IIT Kanpur?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"IIT Kanpur or IITK is considered one of the eminent engineering institutions of the country. The pros of IITK are enlisted below: High-quality academics Excellent placements Research opportunities Flexible curriculum Distinguished faculty Well-equipped infrastructure Emphasis on innovation and entrepreneurship. Vibrant student life because of the student clubs, sports facilities, and cultural events In conclusion, IIT Kanpur is a perfect choice for academically inclined and ambitious candidates.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is IIT Kanpur CSE cutoff trend?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"CSE cut-off for B.Tech programme at IIT Kanpur using JEE Advanced ranks through JoSAA counselling is 283 (General-Gender Neutral) for recent years. Below is a table showing the trend for last three years. Year Cutoff (General - open category) 2026 283 2025 271 2024 252\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the GATE cutoff for M.Tech at IIT Kanpur?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"According to the IIT Kanpur GATE cutoff 2024, the last round closing ranks ranged from 622 to 840 for the General AI category. So, students who score above 630 increase their chances of admission. The higher the score, the better the chances of admission. Check the list below to know the minimum score for different categories. General: 840 OBC: 692 SC: 504 ST: 424 EWS: 693 PWD: 930\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is IIT Kanpur costly?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"IIT Kanpur tuition fee costs around INR 2,000 – INR 13.5 L. This fee is exclusive of other components such as examination fee, application fee, hostel fee, security deposit, etc. This fee is taken from the official website. It is subject to change. Hence, it is moderately costly.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What has been the trend for cut off in BTech in Chemical Engineering in IIT Kanpur?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The cutoff trend for BTech at IIT Kanpur has been decreasing in the recent years. In 2022, the closing rank for BTech under General category for all India quota was 4649. In 2023, it decreased to 4344. Likewise, the cut off ranks have changed from 2034 to 2208 for OBC, 1281 to 1139 for SC, 678 to 706 for ST, 762 to 758 for EWS. This trend is likely to continue in the coming years, as the demand for engineering education in India continues to grow. Similar cut off trend can be seen for female candidates under all categories however the ranks are slightly different.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How are IIT Kanpur placements as compared to other IITs?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The table below compares the IIT Kanpur placement statistics 2023 with other closely ranked IITs: IIT Name the highest Package (2023) Total Offers (2023) IIT Kanpur INR 1.90 crore per annum * 1,200* <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/university/iit-bombay-indian-institute-of-technology-mumbai-54212/placement\\\">IIT Bombay</a> INR 1.68 crore per annum (domestic) INR 3.67 crore per annum (international) 1,788 <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-roorkee-indian-institute-of-technology-3057/placement\\\">IIT Roorkee</a> INR 27.94 LPA* N/A <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kharagpur-indian-institute-of-technology-2999/placement\\\">IIT Kharagpur</a> Above INR 2.68 crore per annum* 1,600+* *The placement data is fetched from multiple media reports.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is IIT Kanpur CAT cutoff 2023?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The final IIT Kanpur CAT cutoff 2023 will be released after the CAT exam results are announced. IIT Kanpur admission 2024 to MBA course is based on CAT scores 2023 followed by the final Interview round. Going as per the last three year trends, IIT Kanpur cutoff 2022 for CAT was 90 Percentile. Tabulated below is IIT Kanpur cutoff for MBA offered through CAT for last three years: Master of Business Administration (MBA) - IIT Kanpur - IME : CAT percentile Cutoff (General-All India) Section 2020 2021 2022 Overall 92.5 90 90 Quants 50 50 50 VA-RC 50 50 50 DI-LR 50 50 50\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How can I get admission in IIT Kanpur?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Check below IIT Kanpur admission process: After the application process is over; students have to go through various selection rounds for final admission. The institute considers the merit of the candidates for MBA and PhD admission. For BTech, MDes, MSc, BSc and MTech courses, JEE Advanced, IIT JAM CEED and GATE scores are considered for the selection of candidates. Additionally, admission to PhD and MS by Research is based on UGC NET/ CSIR NET and other national-level exam scores. After the exams, JoSAA, COAP and CCMN Counselling are conducted for seat allotment to BTech, M.Tech and MSc courses. However, a merit list is released by the institute for announcing the names of the candidates shortlisted for certificate, PhD and MS by Research courses followed by a counselling round. Candidates need to pay the admission fee to confirm their admission.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can we get direct admission in IIT Kanpur?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"IIT Kanpur only offers merit-based admission for all the courses. The institute accepts JEE Advanced scores for admission to BTech. Candidates need to pass JEE Main exam prior to appearing for JEE Advanced. Apart from its flagship programme, Indian Institute of Technology (IIT Kanpur) offers BSc, BS, MTech, MSc, MDes, MBA, along with a few Dual Degree programmes. Admission to all courses is based on scores obtained in the entrance examinations such as GATE, IIT JAM, CEED and CAT. Along with UG and PG courses, IIT Kanpur also offers PhD in various specialisations, admisison to which again is entrance-based.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How can I apply for BS at IIT Kanpur?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"In order to apply for BS at IIT Kanpur, candidates are required to go through the official application of JEE Main followed by applying for JEE Advanced. The application form is submitted automatically after the successful payment of application fees. Read more details around <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/engineering/jee-main-exam-application-form\\\">JEE Main application form and fee 2022</a> here.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How to apply at IIT Kanpur?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"IIT Kanpur conducts the application process online. The step-wise application process is mentioned below: Open the official website and register. Fill in the required info and complete the registration. Fill the detailed application form by providing information around educational qualifications, parents' details, address of communication and permanent address, and exam center preference. Upload scanned images of passport-size photographs and signature. Pay the application fee. The application will be automatically submitted after the successful application amount payment.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I get admission for BTech at IIT Kanpur without JEE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Admission to the BTech programme at IIT Kanpur is entrance exam-based, i.e., based on JEE Main followed by JEE Advanced scores. Candidates seeking admission to BTech can not get admission to IIT Kanpur with only the scores of JEE Main. JEE Advanced followed by JoSAA counselling is the final selection criteria followed by the institute. However, to be eligible for the BTech programme, students are required to have passed their Class 12 with at least 75% aggregate with Science subjects (i.e., Physics, Chemistry and Mathematics). Read on to know more around IIT Kanpur BTech course.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is IIT Kanpur CAT cutoff for OBC category?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"IIT Kanpur CAT cutoff is released for multiple categories, including OBC. Candidaes seeking IIT Kanpur admission 2023 to MBA course is based on CAT. Candidates can check out IIT Kanpur CAT cutoff for OBC category in the table below for last three years: Master of Business Administration (MBA) - IIT Kanpur - IME : CAT percentile Cutoff (OBC-All India) Section 2020 2021 2022 Overall 85 85 85 Quants 50 50 50 VA-RC 50 50 50 DI-LR 50 50 50\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the IIT Kanpur BTech cutoff for female category?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"IIT Kanpur BTech cutoff for female category.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the IIT Kanpur BTech cutoff?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"IIT Kanpur BTech cutoff 2026 ranged from 283 to 7837 in the last round for the General AI category. As per this range, BTech CSE was the most difficult course for admission, with the lowest closing rank of 283. Candidates can check the table below to know the IIT Kanpur BTech cutoff 2026 for different BTech course specialisations. Course IIT Kanpur BTech cutoff 2026 B.Tech. in Computer Science and Engineering 283 B.Tech. in Intelligent Systems 1134 B.Tech. in Electrical Engineering 1171 B.Tech. in Mechanical Engineering 3178 B.Sc. in Economics 3650 B.Tech. in Aerospace Engineering 4015 B.Tech. in Chemical Engineering 4436 B.Tech. in Materials Science and Engineering 6533 B.Tech. in Civil Engineering 7177 B.Tech. in Biological Science and Bioengineering 7837\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the IIT Kanpur cutoff for the OBC category? I want MSc in Statistics.\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"IIT Kanpur cutoff 2026 ranged from 155 in the first round to 173 in the last round for the OBC category candidates under the All India quota. Hence, General AI category candidates need to attain a rank of at least 173 or lower to get a chance at admission. Students should know that just attaining the required rank does not guarantee admission. You would have to complete the entire admission process to be eligible for a final seat offer.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I get IIT Kanpur at 700 rank through GATE exam?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"IIT Kanpur also accepts GATE exam scores for the admission to M.Tech courses. Candidates with 700 score can easily get admission to any course except Discontinued (Jul 2023)-M.Tech. in Microelectronics and VLSI at IIT Kanpur. The IIT Kanpur cutoff 2024 stood between 622 and 840 for the General AI category candidates. The toughest and the easiest course to get into IIT Kanpur were Discontinued (Jul 2023) - M.Tech in Microelectronics and VLSI and Discontinued (Jul 2023)-M.Tech. in Power Engineering for the General AI category candidates. Further, candidates can check out courses available under 700 score at IIT Kanpur: Course 2024 <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-discontinued-sep-22-m-tech-in-signal-processing-communications-and-networks-292884\\\">Discontinued (Sep 22)-M.Tech. in Signal Processing, Communications and Networks</a> 667 <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-discontinued-jul-2023-m-tech-in-microelectronics-and-vlsi-292888\\\">Discontinued (Jul 2023)-M.Tech. in Microelectronics and VLSI</a> 840 <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-discontinued-sep-22-m-tech-in-radio-frequency-and-microwaves-292894\\\">Discontinued (Sep 22)-M.Tech. in Radio Frequency and Microwaves</a> 662 <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-discontinued-jul-2023-m-tech-in-control-and-automation-292968\\\">Discontinued (Jul 2023)-M.Tech. in Control and Automation</a> 667 <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-m-tech-in-photonics-science-and-engineering-292985\\\">M.Tech. in Photonics Science and Engineering</a> 658 <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-discontinued-jul-2023-m-tech-in-power-engineering-292997\\\">Discontinued (Jul 2023)-M.Tech. in Power Engineering</a> 622\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which entrance exam is accepted by IIT Kanpur?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"IIT Kanpur offers admission to all its courses on the basis of both, merit and entrance scores. IIT Kanpur accepts national-level entrance exams. The institute accepts JEE Main, JEE Advanced, CAT, IIT JAM, UGC NET, JEST, CEED, GATE, etc. scores for admission to its courses.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How much rank do you need to get into IIT Kanpur for MSc course?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The rank needed to get into IIT Kanpur would depend on the category and branch chosen. For the General AI category, the highest rank admissible was 900 for the Integrated PhD in Sustainable Energy Engineering programme. To know the maximum rank required by other categories, check the table below. Category Highest Acceptable Rank 2026 General 900 OBC 1322 SC 3192 ST 3515 EWS 1459 PWD 3002\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the cutoff for BTech in IIT Kanpur?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"IIT Kanpur JEE Advanced 2025 cutoffs have been published for admission to various BTech programmes. In Round 6, JEE Advanced cutoffs for 2025 varied between the 271 and 2771 values. Notably, the BTech in CSE is highly competitive among General category students under the All India Quota, with a the lowest Round 6 cutoff rank of 271.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the highest salary offered for IIT Kanpur BTech programme?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"IIT Kanpur has not released course-wise placements information so far for 2022-23 Phase-I placements (which got over in December). According to media reports, phase 1 of the placement session 2022-23 concluded with 1,200 job offers received from over 250 companies. IIT Kanpur the highest package (domestic) stood at INR 1.9 crore per annum. The recruitment drive witnessed 74 international offers and 208 PPOs and a total of 1,198 students accepted the job offers. Further, 33 students received packages of above INR 1 crore per annum during IIT Kanpur placements 2023. For more details on IIT Kanpur placements, click here.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the highest package offered at IIT Kanpur?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The overall IIT Kanpur highest package has not been released yet. Take a look at the table below to know the IIT Kanpur highest package trends for MBA: Course Highest Package (2023) Highest Package (2024) Highest Package (2025) MBA INR 24 LPA INR 24 LPA INR 36 LPA\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the average placement package of IIT Kanpur CSE?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The IIT Kanpur CSE average package for the BTech academic year 2023-24 stood at INR 52.80 LPA. The institute has also released the IIT Kanpur average package 2024 for other branches, which is presented below: Branch Average Package (2024) MBA INR 18.20 LPA AE* INR 20.10 LPA BSBE* INR 13.80 LPA CE* INR 16.30 LPA CHE* INR 18.90 LPA CSE* INR 52.80 LPA EE* INR 27.60 LPA ME* INR 19.70 LPA MSE* INR 17.30 LPA *The statistics mentioned above are gathered from public sources and are for BTech.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What GATE score is required for M.Tech admission at IIT Kanpur?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"As per the details collated from various sources on the internet, a student must have a GATE rank up to 200 or below for admission to M.Tech at IIT Kanpur. While there is no minimum GATE score for IIT admission, the minimum rank/ score requirement depends completely on the individual institutes participating in the admission process. However, keeping the past cut off trends in mind, candidates must score a GATE rank of up to or below 200 and their minimum GATE score must be between 400-800. The closing ranks of GATE COAP 2022 for the General All India category are as follows: Course COAP Round 9 score (General-All India) 2022 Microelectronics and VLSI 717 Control and Automation 678 Power Engineering 650\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How can I get admission in IIT Kanpur for MTech?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Students who want admission to MTech at IIT Kanpur should have a bachelor's degree in Engineering or Science (4-year course) or must have completed their master's degree in Science with the specified marks. A relaxation of 5% aggregate or 0.5 CPI is offered to reserved category candidates.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does IIT Kanpur conduct any interview round for MTech admission?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No, there is no interview round for M.Tech admission at IIT Kanpur. Admission offers for GATE-qualified candidates are displayed on the Common Offer Acceptance Portal (COAP). Students must register at the COAP portal to view and accept their offers. Registration on COAP portal is free. Additionally, candidates are advised to download COAP 2022 information brochure. COAP Registration number is mandatory to apply for M.Tech at IIT Kanpur admission portal. Candidates who have not qualified GATE are communicated directly by the department via e-mail.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Till which date can I fill the choices in JoSAA counselling?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"JoSAA 2027 choice-filling process is yet to begin.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does IIT Kanpur offer scholarships to the students?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"IIT Kanpur offers financial assistance to needy and deserving students. Some of the IITK scholarships are as follows: Scholarships from Donors Scholarship for Free Basic Mess\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How to apply for IIT Kanpur scholarships?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"IIT Kanpur scholarships are for students who fulfil the eligibility criteria. Those who are eligible can go to the official website to apply. The scholarships are offered in a limited number.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How many specialisations does IIT Kanpur offer in MTech?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"IIT Kanpur offers the M.Tech programme in 15 specialisations, including Aerospace Engineering, Computer Science & Engineering, Materials Science & Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, Environmental Engineering & Management, Photonics Science & Engineering, Sustainable Energy Engineering and Earth Sciences. All these specialisations together have a total intake of 736 students spread unevenly.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How is the Mechanical Engineering curriculum at IIT Kanpur?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Mechanical Engineering at IIT Kanpur is a 4-year programme offered in full-time mode. The curriculum covers areas such as applied mathematics, scientific computing, and foundational engineering sciences. IITK offers electives in core areas including Fluid Mechanics, Thermodynamics and Structure and Properties of Materials, Engineering Design and Graphics, and Advanced Mechanics of Solids.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How is the M.Tech curriculum at IITK?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The IIT Kanpur M.Tech course curriculum focuses on core areas of: Microelectronics and VLSI (MVLSI) Power Engineering (PE) RF and Microwaves (RF) Signal Processing, Communication and Networks (SPCOM) Control and Automation (CA) Optoelectronics and Optical Communication (OPTEC)\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How much does BTech cost in IIT Kanpur?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"IIT Kanpur BTech tuition fee costs around INR 8 L. This fee is exclusive of other components such as examination fee, application fee, hostel fee, security deposit, etc. This fee is taken from the official website. It is subject to change.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the NIRF Ranking of IIT Kanpur MBA course?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"NIRF has ranked IIT Kanpur under the 'Management' Category for past three-years. Check below the NIRF rankings: Year Rank 2025 27 2022 29 2023 23\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the rank of IIT Kanpur MBA?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"IIT Kanpur MBA course has been ranked by various ranking Agencies. Check below the 2025 rankings of IIT Kanpur: Ranking Body Rank (2025) NIRF 27\"}}]},\"similarWidgetHeading\":\"Other Popular IITs\",\"predictorUrlFlag\":true,\"beaconData\":{\"hierarchy\":[{\"stream_id\":2,\"substream_id\":0,\"specialization_id\":108,\"primary_hierarchy\":1}],\"baseCourseId\":10,\"credential\":{\"id\":9,\"name\":\"Degree\"},\"level\":{\"id\":14,\"name\":\"UG\"},\"deliveryMethod\":{\"id\":33,\"name\":\"Classroom\"},\"educationType\":{\"id\":20,\"name\":\"Full Time\"},\"cityId\":122,\"stateId\":126,\"flagshipCourseId\":109925,\"examIds\":[6244],\"instituteOwnership\":\"Public/Government\",\"instituteListingType\":\"institute\",\"isInstituteClient\":0},\"ownership\":\"Public/Government,Autonomous\",\"isKnowledgeBoxHidden\":1,\"authorDetails\":{\"authorId\":109142833,\"updatedDate\":\"11-05-2026 14:49\",\"createdDate\":\"2014-08-11T16:24:38\",\"pageType\":\"institute_info\",\"authorDisplayName\":\"JCYMJ438654137\",\"authorImageUrl\":\"\",\"firstName\":\"Mahima\",\"lastName\":\"Aggarwal\",\"description\":\"<p><strong>Role:</strong> Senior Executive Associate, Shiksha.com</p>\\n<p><strong>Education:</strong> BA (Hons) Economics: Delhi University; MA in Economics (IGNOU)</p>\\n<p>Mahima Aggarwal is an Economics postgraduate who has been involved in the education and edtech industry. Mahima’s background includes work related to academia, research, and education. She is familiar with the requirements and challenges faced by students while going through their academic journey. She loves demystifying complex topics and producing relevant content for students.</p>\\n<h3>Highlights:</h3>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Simplifying complex information into structures and a student friendly manner.&nbsp;</li>\\n<li>Contributing to students' decision-making regarding colleges and universities by giving them relevant information.</li>\\n<li>In depth research of content, ensuring accurate and precise information reaches the user.&nbsp;</li>\\n<li>Preparing content around important details like cut offs, scholarships, and placements offered by the universities and institutes.&nbsp;</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h3>Experience:</h3>\\n<p>She worked with Testbook, both as an Operations Associate and as a Subject Matter Expert. In operations, she planned class structures for students preparing for different government examinations by cross team coordinations and as an SME, she was involved in creating content for students preparing for government examinations like banking, SSC, etc. Her journey of UPSC preparation has enhanced her knowledge in various GS subjects as well as given her in depth understanding of students' struggles and concerns while pursuing education, and hence wish to contribute towards information that makes educational decisions easy and well-informed for them.</p>\\n<p><strong>Email:</strong> mahima.aggarwal@shiksha.com</p>\",\"isAbroadAuthor\":false,\"twitterLink\":\"https://x.com/mahimaaggarwal8\",\"facebookLink\":null,\"linkedinLink\