Pdf/feeDetails_25116_195_1795460402.pdf?v=1795464344\",\"scholarshipPdfUrl\":null,\"isRMCEnabled\":0,\"scholarshipsCount\":0,\"intakeDates\":[],\"instituteGrade\":null,\"workExpString\":null,\"averageMoneyRating\":0.0,\"averagePlacementRating\":0.0,\"ratingString\":null,\"ownership\":\"public\",\"currencyConversionFactorMap\":null,\"recentAdmitsData\":null,\"appliedEducationType\":null,\"courseLevel\":\"PG\",\"courseBasicDetails\":null,\"shikshaRank\":null,\"clientId\":null,\"cashbackAmount\":null,\"cashbackStartDate\":null,\"cashbackEndDate\":null,\"cashbackMessage\":null,\"cashbackBannerHeading\":null,\"instituteId\":25116,\"examSeasonalCtaInfo\":null,\"cashbackDataExist\":false}],\"sectionToAnaTaggedFaqDataMap\":{\"ovp_section_highlights\":[{\"anaFaqId\":89007150,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_highlights\",\"questionId\":8067703,\"answerId\":8067725,\"questionText\":\"How is the placement scenario at IIT Kanpur? \",\"answerText\":\"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The institute has not released the placement report incorporating the overall data for the 2026 drive. However, the institute have disclosed the 2026 placement statistics till Phase I. As per the reports, over 250 recruiters participated and presented 1202 offers to the students. 1079 students were placed, of which 15 students&nbsp;have got&nbsp;international placements.&nbsp;</p>\",\"order\":0,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/how-is-the-placement-scenario-at-iit-kanpur-qna-8067703\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":53,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":244708,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":3,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-01-23T16:34:04\",\"context\":\"Placements\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":120474737,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_highlights\",\"questionId\":7910565,\"answerId\":7910579,\"questionText\":\"Is IIT Kanpur good for MBA? \",\"answerText\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">IIT Kanpur offers MBA via Department of Management Sciences (DoMS). The MBA course of the institute has been ranked by various agencies. Under the 'Management Category', NIRF ranked IIT Kanpur at 23rd position in 2023 rankings. Business Today also ranked IIT Kanpur at 32 position. Talking about placements, IIT Kanpur highest package recorded for MBA was INR 24 LPA. The median CTC was INR 17.25 LPA.</p><p style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">In Summer Placement (2022-24), the highest stipend offered to students was INR 17.01 lakh whereas, median stipend was INR 1 lakh.</p>\",\"order\":1,\"answerCount\":2,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/is-iit-kanpur-good-for-mba-qna-7910565\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":45,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.013514,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":239490,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2023-10-09T10:30:03\",\"context\":\"Overview\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":118223367,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_highlights\",\"questionId\":8734939,\"answerId\":8734941,\"questionText\":\"Which are the top companies visiting IIT Kanpur for M.Tech placements? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>As per the verified students' reviews on Shiksha, top companies, such as Barclays, Flipkart, Qualcomm, Bajaj, HSBC, Tata Motors and Intel come for final placements at IIT Kanpur for MTech. Students get roles from technical research profiles to analytical roles. Additionaly, the institute in 2022 recorded a the highest domestic package of INR 1.9 crore per annum (not just for M.Tech but overall across courses).&nbsp;</p>\",\"order\":2,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/which-are-the-top-companies-visiting-iit-kanpur-for-m-tech-placements-qna-8734939\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":51,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":319102,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2023-11-28T13:30:05\",\"context\":\"Placements\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":140326759,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_highlights\",\"questionId\":8067511,\"answerId\":8067525,\"questionText\":\"Is IIT Kanpur good for placement? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>As of now, the institute has released the phase-I placement statistics. A total of 1079&nbsp;students were placed and 1202 job offers were distributed among them. Check the complete insights of IIT Kanpur placements 2026 from the table below:</p><table style=\\\"width: 80.9684%;\\\"><tbody><tr><th style=\\\"width: 47.0306%;\\\"><p>Particulars</p></th><th style=\\\"width: 52.9095%;\\\"><p>Placement Statistics (2026) Phase I</p></th></tr><tr><td style=\\\"width: 47.0306%;\\\"><p>Total job offers</p></td><td style=\\\"width: 52.9095%;\\\"><p>1202&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"width: 47.0306%;\\\"><p>Students placed</p></td><td style=\\\"width: 52.9095%;\\\"><p>1079&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"width: 47.0306%;\\\"><p>International offers</p></td><td style=\\\"width: 52.9095%;\\\"><p>15</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"width: 47.0306%;\\\"><p>Top Recruiters</p></td><td style=\\\"width: 52.9095%;\\\"><p>Accenture, American Express, BlackRock, Boeing, Databricks</p></td></tr></tbody></table>\",\"order\":3,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/is-iit-kanpur-good-for-placement-qna-8067511\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":53,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":239808,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":3,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-01-23T16:35:33\",\"context\":\"Placements\",\"isStale\":false}],\"ovp_section_infrastructure\":[{\"anaFaqId\":86474174,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_infrastructure\",\"questionId\":7819045,\"answerId\":7819063,\"questionText\":\"Does IIT Kanpur offer hostel facilities to its students? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>Yes, IIT Kanpur offer the most spacious hostels and the largest rooms for the students along with 22 hours of eating facilities available in the campus ranging from some well-known food chains to hostel canteens which are well-stocked. Every hostel has a basketball court, few badminton courts, a volleyball court, table tennis room, a television room, a computer room, a reading room for newspaper, magazines, journals, etc., and a hall office to handle hostel affairs.</p>\",\"order\":0,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/does-iit-kanpur-offer-hostel-facilities-to-its-students-qna-7819045\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":39,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":241492,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2023-09-15T17:10:10\",\"context\":\"Infrastructure\",\"isStale\":false}],\"ovp_section_fAQs\":[{\"anaFaqId\":170200296,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":8734409,\"answerId\":8734411,\"questionText\":\"What is the fee for the BSc programme at IIT Kanpur?\",\"answerText\":\"<p>The total fee for the four-year BS programme of IIT Kanpur is INR 8 lakh. This is inclusive of the one-time admission and caution deposits but is not inclusive of the hostel fee. However, this fee is sourced from unofficial sources. Hence, is indicative. For the exact fee, students can reach out to the admission office. Other than this, students are required to pay the JEE Main application fee which is INR 625 (for boys) and INR 325 (for girls). For JEE Advanced, the application fee ranges from INR 1,400 to INR 2,800 for different category students.&nbsp;</p>\",\"order\":0,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/what-is-the-fee-for-the-bsc-programme-at-iit-kanpur-qna-8734409\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":33,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":239478,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2023-11-28T10:18:23\",\"context\":\"Fees\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":106443792,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":8734421,\"answerId\":8734423,\"questionText\":\"Is the BSc degree from IIT Kanpur worth it? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>The best way to understand whether a college is worth picking for any course is by taking the reviews of the college and course from current or past students. The below list highlights the review of BSc course offered by IIT Kanpur. These reviews are fetched from multiple verified students' reviews available on Shiksha for BSc at IIT Kanpur. Check what students have to say in the below pointers:</p><ul><li>Almost 95% of students get placed every year in our college. Students get placed with the average salary package of 20 LPA.</li><li>IIT Kanpur is a very good college for research</li><li>Companies such as Intel, American Express, Jio, Qualcomm and JP Morgan visit the college for placements</li><li>Top roles offered here include Software Developer, Business Analyst, Management Consultant, etc.</li><li>There is unlimited Wi-Fi availability with a speed of around 100 Mbps. The classrooms are excellent. They can accommodate 50 to 600 students.&nbsp;</li><li>It has the best teachers in our country. They are highly qualified</li><li>The professors are highly qualified and supportive. They are always ready to help you in academics.</li></ul><p>To read more BSc reviews for IIT Kanpur, &nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/reviews? bc=26\\\">check out this link</a>.</p>\",\"order\":1,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/is-the-bsc-degree-from-iit-kanpur-worth-it-qna-8734421\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":45,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":null,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2023-11-28T10:20:13\",\"context\":\"Overview\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":170200298,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":8734405,\"answerId\":8734407,\"questionText\":\"Which exam do I need to write to pursue BS from IIT Kanpur? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>Candidates seeking admission to BS at IIT Kanpur must have a valid score in JEE Main, JEE Advanced and go through JoSAA counselling for final admission. Admission is completely entrance exam-based and candidates seeking admission can not get into IIT Kanpur with only the scores of JEE Main. JEE Advanced followed by JoSAA counselling is the mandatory requirement. Additionally, to be eligible for the BSc programme, students are required to have passed their Class 12 with at least 75% aggregate with Science subjects (i.e., Physics, Chemistry and Mathematics).&nbsp;</p>\",\"order\":2,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/which-exam-do-i-need-to-write-to-pursue-bs-from-iit-kanpur-qna-8734405\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":23,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":null,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2023-11-28T10:17:56\",\"context\":\"Eligibility\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":167210464,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":12860999,\"answerId\":12861035,\"questionText\":\"How is BTech in CSE at IIT Kanpur? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>BTech CSE is the most sought after BTech specialisation at IIT Kanpur. The course is offered in full-time mode for a span of 4 years. BTech CSE students at IITK have bagged excellent placement packages over the years. In 2024, the vaerage package for BTech CSE stood at INR 52.8 LPA.&nbsp;</p><p>Further, the course curriculum offers a strong foundation in Science and maths in the first 2 years, followed by highly advanced professional courses and electives in the last 2 years of the course. It is also the most competitve BTech branch with a closing cutoff rank of 271 in 2025.</p>\",\"order\":3,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/how-is-btech-in-cse-at-iit-kanpur-qna-12860999\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":7,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":null,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-06-10T15:30:04\",\"context\":\"Comparison\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":133975545,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":12842799,\"answerId\":12842989,\"questionText\":\"Why choose IIT Kanpur? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>IIT Kanpur or IITK is considered one of the eminent engineering institutions of the country. The pros of IITK are enlisted below:</p><ul><li>High-quality academics</li><li>Excellent placements</li><li>Research opportunities</li><li>Flexible curriculum</li><li>Distinguished faculty</li><li>Well-equipped infrastructure</li><li>Emphasis on innovation and entrepreneurship.</li><li>Vibrant student life because of the student clubs, sports facilities, and cultural events</li></ul><p>In conclusion, IIT Kanpur is a perfect choice for academically inclined and ambitious candidates.</p>\",\"order\":4,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/why-choose-iit-kanpur-qna-12842799\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":45,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":null,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-06-01T16:13:33\",\"context\":\"Overview\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":170200300,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":13050882,\"answerId\":13050884,\"questionText\":\"What is IIT Kanpur CSE cutoff trend? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>CSE cut-off for B.Tech programme at IIT Kanpur using JEE Advanced ranks through JoSAA counselling is 283 (General-Gender Neutral) for recent years. Below is a table showing the trend for last three years.</p><table style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.012%; height: 121.528px;\\\" border=\\\"1\\\"><colgroup><col style=\\\"width: 37.2483%;\\\"><col style=\\\"width: 62.7061%;\\\"></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\\\"height: 54.375px;\\\"><th style=\\\"height: 54.375px;\\\">Year</th><th style=\\\"height: 54.375px;\\\"><p>Cutoff (General - open category)</p></th></tr><tr style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\"><td style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\">2026&nbsp;</td><td style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\">&nbsp;283&nbsp;</td></tr><tr style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\"><td style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\">2025</td><td style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\">271</td></tr><tr style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\"><td style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\">2024</td><td style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\">252</td></tr></tbody></table><div data-bfc=\\\"\\\" data-sfc-cp=\\\"\\\" data-sfc-root=\\\"c\\\" data-ved=\\\"2ahUKEwjahofrl4-YAxXUT2wGHXKYDYcQi4wTegYIAggIEAo\\\" data-hveid=\\\"CAIICBAK\\\">&nbsp;</div><div data-bfc=\\\"\\\" data-sfc-cp=\\\"\\\" data-sfc-root=\\\"c\\\" data-ved=\\\"2ahUKEwjahofrl4-YAxXUT2wGHXKYDYcQi4wTegYIAggIEA4\\\" data-hveid=\\\"CAIICBAO\\\"><p>&nbsp;</p></div><p>&nbsp;</p>\",\"order\":5,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/what-is-iit-kanpur-cse-cutoff-trend-qna-13050882\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":23,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":null,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-11-17T19:49:35\",\"context\":\"Eligibility\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":167210466,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":12974325,\"answerId\":12974345,\"questionText\":\"What is the GATE cutoff for M.Tech at IIT Kanpur? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>According to the <strong>IIT Kanpur GATE cutoff 2024</strong>, the last round closing ranks ranged from <strong>622</strong> to <strong>840</strong> for the General AI category. So, students who score above&nbsp;<strong>630</strong>&nbsp;increase their chances of admission. The higher the score, the better the chances of admission. Check the list below to know the minimum score for different categories.</p><ul><li>General: 840</li><li>OBC: 692</li><li>SC: 504</li><li>ST: 424</li><li>EWS: 693</li><li>PWD: 930</li></ul>\",\"order\":6,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/what-is-the-gate-cutoff-for-m-tech-at-iit-kanpur-qna-12974325\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":23,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":null,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-08-26T09:46:29\",\"context\":\"Eligibility\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":153243275,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":12694335,\"answerId\":12694337,\"questionText\":\"Is IIT Kanpur costly? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>IIT Kanpur tuition fee costs around INR 2,000 – INR 13.5 L. This fee is exclusive of other components such as examination fee, application fee, hostel fee, security deposit, etc. This fee is taken from the official website. It is subject to change. Hence, it is moderately costly.</p>\",\"order\":7,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/is-iit-kanpur-costly-qna-12694335\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"manual\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":35,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":239476,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-03-20T15:07:03\",\"context\":\"Fees\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":167210472,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":7550259,\"answerId\":7550265,\"questionText\":\"What has been the trend for cut off in BTech in Chemical Engineering in IIT Kanpur? \",\"answerText\":\"<p><span data-sheets-value=\\\"{\\\"1\\\":2,\\\"2\\\":\\\"The cutoff trend for B.Tech at IIT Kanpur - Indian Institute of Technology has been decreasing in the recent years. In 2022, the closing rank for B.Tech. under general category for all India quota was 4649. In 2023, it decreased to 4344. Likewise, the cut off ranks have changed from 2034 to 2208 for OBC, 1281 to 1139 for SC, 678 to 706 for ST, 762 to 758 for EWS. This trend is likely to continue in the coming years, as the demand for engineering education in India continues to grow. Similar cut off trend can be seen for female candidates under all categories however the ranks are slightly different.\\\"}\\\" data-sheets-userformat=\\\"{\\\"2\\\":15233,\\\"3\\\":{\\\"1\\\":0},\\\"10\\\":0,\\\"11\\\":3,\\\"12\\\":0,\\\"14\\\":{\\\"1\\\":2,\\\"2\\\":0},\\\"15\\\":\\\"Calibri, sans-serif\\\",\\\"16\\\":11}\\\">The cutoff trend for BTech at IIT Kanpur has been decreasing in the recent years. In 2022, the closing rank for BTech under General category for all India quota was 4649. In 2023, it decreased to 4344. Likewise, the cut off ranks have changed from 2034 to 2208 for OBC, 1281 to 1139 for SC, 678 to 706 for ST, 762 to 758 for EWS. This trend is likely to continue in the coming years, as the demand for engineering education in India continues to grow. Similar cut off trend can be seen for female candidates under all categories however the ranks are slightly different.</span></p>\",\"order\":8,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/what-has-been-the-trend-for-cut-off-in-btech-in-chemical-engineering-in-iit-kanpur-qna-7550259\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":9,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":null,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2023-09-06T09:42:48\",\"context\":\"Comparison\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":167210474,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":11523930,\"answerId\":11523942,\"questionText\":\"How are IIT Kanpur placements as compared to other IITs? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>The table below compares the IIT Kanpur placement statistics 2023 with other closely ranked IITs:</p><table border=\\\"1\\\"><tbody><tr><th>IIT Name</th><th>the highest Package (2023)</th><th>Total Offers (2023)</th></tr><tr><td>IIT Kanpur</td><td>INR 1.90 crore per annum *</td><td>1,200*</td></tr><tr><td>&lt;a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/university/iit-bombay-indian-institute-of-technology-mumbai-54212/placement\\\"&gt;IIT Bombay&lt;/a&gt;</td><td><p>INR 1.68 crore per annum (domestic)</p><p>INR 3.67 crore per annum (international)</p></td><td><p>1,788</p></td></tr><tr><td>&lt;a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-roorkee-indian-institute-of-technology-3057/placement\\\"&gt;IIT Roorkee&lt;/a&gt;</td><td>INR 27.94 LPA*</td><td>N/A</td></tr><tr><td>&lt;a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kharagpur-indian-institute-of-technology-2999/placement\\\"&gt;IIT Kharagpur&lt;/a&gt;</td><td>Above INR 2.68 crore per annum*</td><td>1,600+*</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>*The placement data is fetched from multiple media reports.</em></p><div>&nbsp;</div>\",\"order\":9,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/how-are-iit-kanpur-placements-as-compared-to-other-iits-qna-11523930\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":7,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":318954,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2025-06-19T12:10:18\",\"context\":\"Comparison\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":167210482,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":7790755,\"answerId\":7790811,\"questionText\":\"What is IIT Kanpur CAT cutoff 2023? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>The final IIT Kanpur CAT cutoff 2023 will be released after the CAT exam results are announced. IIT Kanpur admission 2024 to MBA course is based on CAT scores 2023 followed by the final Interview round. Going as per the last three year trends, IIT Kanpur cutoff 2022 for CAT was 90 Percentile. Tabulated below is IIT Kanpur cutoff for MBA offered through CAT&nbsp; for last three years:</p><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\\\"4\\\">Master of Business Administration (MBA) - IIT Kanpur - IME : CAT percentile Cutoff (General-All India)</th></tr><tr><td style=\\\"background-color: rgb (236,  240,  241);\\\"><strong>Section</strong></td><td style=\\\"background-color: rgb (236,  240,  241);\\\"><strong>2020</strong></td><td style=\\\"background-color: rgb (236,  240,  241);\\\"><strong>2021</strong></td><td style=\\\"background-color: rgb (236,  240,  241);\\\"><strong>2022</strong></td></tr></thead><thead></thead><tbody><tr><td>Overall</td><td>92.5</td><td>90</td><td>90</td></tr><tr><td>Quants</td><td>50</td><td>50</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>VA-RC</td><td>50</td><td>50</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>DI-LR</td><td>50</td><td>50</td><td>50</td></tr></tbody></table>\",\"order\":10,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/what-is-iit-kanpur-cat-cutoff-2023-qna-7790755\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":23,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":240866,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2023-09-13T10:10:05\",\"context\":\"Eligibility\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":170200302,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":7792767,\"answerId\":7792775,\"questionText\":\"How can I get admission in IIT Kanpur?\",\"answerText\":\"<p>Check below IIT Kanpur admission process:</p><ul><li>After the application process is over; students have to go through various selection rounds for final admission. The institute considers the merit of the candidates for MBA and PhD admission.&nbsp;</li><li>For BTech, MDes, MSc, BSc and MTech courses, JEE Advanced, IIT JAM CEED and GATE scores are considered for the selection of candidates.</li><li>Additionally, admission to PhD and MS by Research is based on UGC NET/ CSIR NET and other national-level exam scores.</li><li>After the exams, JoSAA, COAP and CCMN Counselling are conducted for seat allotment to BTech, M.Tech and MSc courses. However, a merit list is released by the institute for announcing the names of the candidates shortlisted for certificate, PhD and MS by Research courses followed by a counselling round. Candidates need to pay the admission fee to confirm their admission.</li></ul>\",\"order\":11,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/how-can-i-get-admission-in-iit-kanpur-qna-7792767\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":1,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":239494,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":2,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2023-10-09T13:02:13\",\"context\":\"Admissions\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":170200304,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":7792783,\"answerId\":7792785,\"questionText\":\"Can we get direct admission in IIT Kanpur?\",\"answerText\":\"<p>IIT Kanpur only offers merit-based admission for all the courses. The institute accepts JEE Advanced scores for admission to BTech. Candidates need to pass JEE Main exam prior to appearing for JEE Advanced. Apart from its flagship programme, Indian Institute of Technology (IIT Kanpur) offers BSc, BS, MTech, MSc, MDes, MBA, along with a few Dual Degree programmes. Admission to all courses is based on scores obtained in the entrance examinations such as GATE, IIT JAM, CEED and CAT. Along with UG and PG courses, IIT Kanpur also offers PhD in various specialisations, admisison to which again is entrance-based.</p>\",\"order\":12,\"answerCount\":3,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/can-we-get-direct-admission-in-iit-kanpur-qna-7792783\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":3,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":318002,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":1,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-02-09T17:01:59\",\"context\":\"Admissions\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":159583447,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":8734413,\"answerId\":8734415,\"questionText\":\"How can I apply for BS at IIT Kanpur? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>In order to apply for BS at IIT Kanpur, candidates are required to go through the official application of JEE Main followed by applying for JEE Advanced. The application form is submitted automatically after the successful payment of application fees. Read more details around&nbsp;&lt;a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/engineering/jee-main-exam-application-form\\\"&gt;JEE Main application form and fee 2022&lt;/a&gt;&nbsp;here.</p>\",\"order\":13,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/how-can-i-apply-for-bs-at-iit-kanpur-qna-8734413\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":1,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":318936,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2025-10-09T13:34:49\",\"context\":\"Admissions\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":167210478,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":12694309,\"answerId\":12694315,\"questionText\":\"How to apply at IIT Kanpur? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>IIT Kanpur conducts the application process online. The step-wise application process is mentioned below:</p><ol><li>Open the official website and register.</li><li>Fill in the required info and complete the registration.</li><li>Fill the detailed application form by providing information around educational qualifications, parents' details, address of communication and permanent address, and exam center preference.</li><li>Upload scanned images of passport-size photographs and signature.</li><li>Pay the application fee.</li><li>The application will be automatically submitted after the successful application amount payment.</li></ol>\",\"order\":14,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/how-to-apply-at-iit-kanpur-qna-12694309\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":1,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":318938,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-03-26T15:46:18\",\"context\":\"Admissions\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":168715012,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":7792855,\"answerId\":7792857,\"questionText\":\"Can I get admission for BTech at IIT Kanpur without JEE? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>Admission to the BTech programme at IIT Kanpur is entrance exam-based, i.e., based on JEE Main followed by JEE Advanced scores. Candidates seeking admission to BTech can not get admission to IIT Kanpur with only the scores of JEE Main. JEE Advanced followed by JoSAA counselling is the final selection criteria followed by the institute. However, to be eligible for the BTech programme, students are required to have passed their Class 12 with at least 75% aggregate with Science subjects (i.e., Physics, Chemistry and Mathematics). <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/be-btech-bc\\\">Read on to know more around IIT Kanpur BTech course</a>.&nbsp;</p>\",\"order\":15,\"answerCount\":2,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/can-i-get-admission-for-btech-at-iit-kanpur-without-jee-qna-7792855\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":3,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":239654,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2023-09-13T14:30:47\",\"context\":\"Admissions\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":167210480,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":7790817,\"answerId\":7790821,\"questionText\":\"What is IIT Kanpur CAT cutoff for OBC category?\",\"answerText\":\"<p>IIT Kanpur CAT cutoff is released for multiple categories, including OBC. Candidaes seeking IIT Kanpur admission 2023 to MBA course is based on CAT. Candidates can check out IIT Kanpur CAT cutoff for OBC category in the table below for last three years:&nbsp;</p><table><thead><tr><th colspan=\\\"4\\\">Master of Business Administration (MBA) - IIT Kanpur - IME : CAT percentile Cutoff (OBC-All India)</th></tr><tr><td><strong>Section</strong></td><td><strong>2020</strong></td><td><strong>2021</strong></td><td><strong>2022</strong></td></tr></thead><thead></thead><tbody><tr><td>Overall</td><td>85</td><td>85</td><td>85</td></tr><tr><td>Quants</td><td>50</td><td>50</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>VA-RC</td><td>50</td><td>50</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>DI-LR</td><td>50</td><td>50</td><td>50</td></tr></tbody></table>\",\"order\":16,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/what-is-iit-kanpur-cat-cutoff-for-obc-category-qna-7790817\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":23,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":242150,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2023-09-13T10:05:11\",\"context\":\"Eligibility\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":151539153,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":12974419,\"answerId\":12974421,\"questionText\":\"What is the IIT Kanpur BTech cutoff for female category? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>&nbsp;IIT Kanpur BTech cutoff for female category.</p>\",\"order\":17,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/what-is-the-iit-kanpur-btech-cutoff-for-female-category-qna-12974419\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":23,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":null,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-09-01T16:39:53\",\"context\":\"Eligibility\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":151539155,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":12974393,\"answerId\":12974407,\"questionText\":\"What is the IIT Kanpur BTech cutoff? \",\"answerText\":\"<p><strong>IIT Kanpur BTech cutoff 2026</strong> ranged from <strong>283</strong> to <strong>7837 </strong>in the last round for the General AI category. As per this range, BTech CSE was the most difficult course for admission, with the lowest closing rank of&nbsp;<strong>283</strong>. Candidates can check the table below to know the <strong>IIT Kanpur BTech cutoff 2026&nbsp;</strong>for different BTech course specialisations.&nbsp;</p><table style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.9923%;\\\" border=\\\"1\\\"><colgroup><col style=\\\"width: 50.0662%;\\\"><col style=\\\"width: 50.0662%;\\\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th>Course</th><th>IIT Kanpur BTech cutoff 2026</th></tr><tr><td width=\\\"237\\\" height=\\\"19\\\">B.Tech. in Computer Science and Engineering</td><td align=\\\"right\\\" width=\\\"163\\\">283</td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"19\\\">B.Tech. in Intelligent Systems</td><td align=\\\"right\\\">1134</td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"19\\\">B.Tech. in Electrical Engineering</td><td align=\\\"right\\\">1171</td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"19\\\">B.Tech. in Mechanical Engineering</td><td align=\\\"right\\\">3178</td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"19\\\">B.Sc. in Economics</td><td align=\\\"right\\\">3650</td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"19\\\">B.Tech. in Aerospace Engineering</td><td align=\\\"right\\\">4015</td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"19\\\">B.Tech. in Chemical Engineering</td><td align=\\\"right\\\">4436</td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"19\\\">B.Tech. in Materials Science and Engineering</td><td align=\\\"right\\\">6533</td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"19\\\">B.Tech. in Civil Engineering</td><td align=\\\"right\\\">7177</td></tr><tr><td height=\\\"19\\\">B.Tech. in Biological Science and Bioengineering</td><td align=\\\"right\\\">7837</td></tr></tbody></table>\",\"order\":18,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/what-is-the-iit-kanpur-btech-cutoff-qna-12974393\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":23,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":null,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-08-26T10:44:33\",\"context\":\"Eligibility\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":151539159,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"questionId\":12974311,\"answerId\":12974321,\"questionText\":\"What is the IIT Kanpur cutoff for the OBC category? I want MSc in Statistics.\",\"answerText\":\"<p><strong>IIT Kanpur cutoff 2026</strong> ranged from <strong>155</strong> in the first round to <strong>173 </strong>in the last round for the OBC category candidates under the All India quota. Hence, General AI category candidates need to attain a rank of at least&nbsp;<strong>173</strong> or lower to get a chance at admission. </p><p>Students should know that just attaining the required rank does not guarantee admission. You would have to complete the entire admission process to be eligible for a final seat offer.</p>\",\"order\":19,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/what-is-the-iit-kanpur-cutoff-for-the-obc-category-i-want-msc-in-statistics-qna-12974311\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":23,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":null,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-08-26T09:36:24\",\"context\":\"Eligibility\",\"isStale\":false}],\"ovp_section_cutoff\":[{\"anaFaqId\":135589623,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_cutoff\",\"questionId\":10831186,\"answerId\":10831252,\"questionText\":\"Can I get IIT Kanpur at 700 rank through GATE exam? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>IIT Kanpur also accepts GATE exam scores for the admission to M.Tech courses. Candidates with 700 score can easily get admission to any course except <strong>Discontinued (Jul 2023)-M.Tech. in Microelectronics and VLSI </strong>at IIT Kanpur. The IIT Kanpur cutoff 2024 stood between <strong>622 and 840</strong> for the General AI category candidates. The toughest and the easiest course to get into IIT Kanpur were <strong>Discontinued (Jul 2023) - M.Tech in Microelectronics and VLSI</strong> and <strong>Discontinued (Jul 2023)-M.Tech. in Power Engineering </strong>for the General AI category candidates. Further, candidates can check out courses available under 700 score at IIT Kanpur:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Course</th><th>2024</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>&lt;a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-discontinued-sep-22-m-tech-in-signal-processing-communications-and-networks-292884\\\"&gt;Discontinued (Sep 22)-M.Tech. in Signal Processing, Communications and Networks&lt;/a&gt;</td><td>667</td></tr><tr><td>&lt;a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-discontinued-jul-2023-m-tech-in-microelectronics-and-vlsi-292888\\\"&gt;Discontinued (Jul 2023)-M.Tech. in Microelectronics and VLSI&lt;/a&gt;</td><td>840</td></tr><tr><td>&lt;a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-discontinued-sep-22-m-tech-in-radio-frequency-and-microwaves-292894\\\"&gt;Discontinued (Sep 22)-M.Tech. in Radio Frequency and Microwaves&lt;/a&gt;</td><td>662</td></tr><tr><td>&lt;a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-discontinued-jul-2023-m-tech-in-control-and-automation-292968\\\"&gt;Discontinued (Jul 2023)-M.Tech. in Control and Automation&lt;/a&gt;</td><td>667</td></tr><tr><td>&lt;a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-m-tech-in-photonics-science-and-engineering-292985\\\"&gt;M.Tech. in Photonics Science and Engineering&lt;/a&gt;</td><td>658</td></tr><tr><td>&lt;a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-discontinued-jul-2023-m-tech-in-power-engineering-292997\\\"&gt;Discontinued (Jul 2023)-M.Tech. in Power Engineering&lt;/a&gt;</td><td>622</td></tr></tbody></table>\",\"order\":0,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/can-i-get-iit-kanpur-at-700-rank-through-gate-exam-qna-10831186\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":21,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.013514,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":319180,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2025-01-03T11:50:06\",\"context\":\"Cut Off\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":159703013,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_cutoff\",\"questionId\":12694301,\"answerId\":12694303,\"questionText\":\"Which entrance exam is accepted by IIT Kanpur? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>IIT Kanpur offers admission to all its courses on the basis of both, merit and entrance scores. IIT Kanpur accepts national-level entrance exams. The institute accepts JEE Main, JEE Advanced, CAT, IIT JAM, UGC NET, JEST, CEED, GATE, etc. scores for admission to its courses.</p>\",\"order\":1,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/which-entrance-exam-is-accepted-by-iit-kanpur-qna-12694301\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"manual\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":23,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":239734,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-03-20T15:02:13\",\"context\":\"Eligibility\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":151539149,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_cutoff\",\"questionId\":12972973,\"answerId\":12973053,\"questionText\":\"How much rank do you need to get into IIT Kanpur for MSc course? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>The rank needed to get into IIT Kanpur would depend on the category and branch chosen. For the General AI category, the highest rank admissible was <strong>900</strong> for the Integrated PhD in Sustainable Energy Engineering programme.&nbsp;</p><p>To know the maximum rank required by other categories, check the table below.</p><table style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.9984%; height: 89.5372px;\\\" border=\\\"1\\\"><colgroup><col style=\\\"width: 50%;\\\"><col style=\\\"width: 50%;\\\"></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\"><th style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\">Category</th><th style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\">Highest Acceptable Rank 2026</th></tr><tr style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\"><td style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\">General</td><td style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\">900</td></tr><tr style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\"><td style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\">OBC</td><td style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\">1322</td></tr><tr style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\"><td style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\">SC</td><td style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\">3192</td></tr><tr><td>ST</td><td>3515</td></tr><tr><td>EWS</td><td>1459</td></tr><tr><td>PWD</td><td>3002</td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p>\",\"order\":2,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/how-much-rank-do-you-need-to-get-into-iit-kanpur-for-msc-course-qna-12972973\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":19,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":null,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-08-25T11:51:44\",\"context\":\"Cut Off\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":107195177,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_cutoff\",\"questionId\":12694331,\"answerId\":12694333,\"questionText\":\"What is the cutoff for BTech in IIT Kanpur? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>IIT Kanpur JEE Advanced 2025 cutoffs have been published for admission to various BTech programmes. In Round 6, JEE Advanced cutoffs for 2025 varied between the 271 and 2771 values. Notably, the BTech in CSE is highly competitive among General category students under the All India Quota, with a the lowest Round 6 cutoff rank of 271.</p>\",\"order\":3,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/what-is-the-cutoff-for-btech-in-iit-kanpur-qna-12694331\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"manual\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":23,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":null,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-03-20T15:10:06\",\"context\":\"Eligibility\",\"isStale\":false}],\"ovp_section_placements\":[{\"anaFaqId\":167210462,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_placements\",\"questionId\":7768621,\"answerId\":7768623,\"questionText\":\"What is the highest salary offered for IIT Kanpur BTech programme? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>&nbsp;IIT Kanpur has not released course-wise placements information so far for 2022-23 Phase-I placements (which got over in December).&nbsp; According to media reports, phase 1 of the placement session 2022-23 concluded with 1,200 job offers received from over 250 companies. IIT Kanpur the highest package (domestic) stood at INR 1.9 crore per annum. The recruitment drive witnessed 74 international offers and 208 PPOs and a total of 1,198 students accepted the job offers. Further,  33 students received packages of above INR 1 crore per annum during IIT Kanpur placements 2023. For more details on IIT Kanpur placements, &nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/placement\\\">click here</a>.&nbsp;</p>\",\"order\":0,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/what-is-the-highest-salary-offered-for-iit-kanpur-btech-programme-qna-7768621\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":51,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":null,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":1,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-03-26T01:12:16\",\"context\":\"Placements\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":124332111,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_placements\",\"questionId\":8067545,\"answerId\":8067589,\"questionText\":\"What is the highest package offered at IIT Kanpur?\",\"answerText\":\"<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">The overall IIT Kanpur highest package has not been released yet. Take a look at the table below to know the IIT Kanpur highest package trends for MBA:</p><div dir=\\\"ltr\\\" align=\\\"left\\\"><table><colgroup><col width=\\\"156\\\"><col width=\\\"156\\\"><col style=\\\"width: 77.5px;\\\" width=\\\"155\\\"><col style=\\\"width: 77.5px;\\\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th><p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Course</p></th><th><p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Highest Package (2023)</p></th><th><p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Highest Package (2024)</p></th><th><p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Highest Package (2025)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">MBA</p></td><td><p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">INR 24 LPA</p></td><td><p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">INR 24 LPA</p></td><td><p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">INR 36 LPA</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\",\"order\":1,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/what-is-the-highest-package-offered-at-iit-kanpur-qna-8067545\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":51,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":239922,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":1,\"dislikesCount\":2,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-11-24T16:18:09\",\"context\":\"Placements\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":124332113,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_placements\",\"questionId\":8067681,\"answerId\":8067699,\"questionText\":\"What is the average placement package of IIT Kanpur CSE?\",\"answerText\":\"<p>The IIT Kanpur CSE average package for the BTech academic year 2023-24 stood at INR 52.80 LPA. The institute has also released the IIT Kanpur average package 2024 for other branches, which is presented below:</p><table style=\\\"width: 78.881%;\\\" border=\\\"1\\\"><tbody><tr><th style=\\\"width: 48.3795%;\\\">Branch</th><th style=\\\"width: 51.5847%;\\\">Average Package (2024)</th></tr><tr><td style=\\\"width: 48.3795%;\\\">MBA</td><td style=\\\"width: 51.5847%;\\\">INR 18.20 LPA</td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"width: 48.3795%;\\\">AE*</td><td style=\\\"width: 51.5847%;\\\">INR 20.10 LPA</td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"width: 48.3795%;\\\">BSBE*</td><td style=\\\"width: 51.5847%;\\\">INR 13.80 LPA</td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"width: 48.3795%;\\\">CE*</td><td style=\\\"width: 51.5847%;\\\">INR 16.30 LPA</td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"width: 48.3795%;\\\">CHE*</td><td style=\\\"width: 51.5847%;\\\">INR 18.90 LPA</td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"width: 48.3795%;\\\">CSE*</td><td style=\\\"width: 51.5847%;\\\">INR 52.80 LPA</td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"width: 48.3795%;\\\">EE*</td><td style=\\\"width: 51.5847%;\\\">INR 27.60 LPA</td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"width: 48.3795%;\\\">ME*</td><td style=\\\"width: 51.5847%;\\\">INR 19.70 LPA</td></tr><tr><td style=\\\"width: 48.3795%;\\\">MSE*</td><td style=\\\"width: 51.5847%;\\\">INR 17.30 LPA</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>*The statistics mentioned above are gathered from public sources and are for BTech.</em></p>\",\"order\":2,\"answerCount\":2,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/what-is-the-average-placement-package-of-iit-kanpur-cse-qna-8067681\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":51,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":241514,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2024-06-17T16:55:12\",\"context\":\"Placements\",\"isStale\":false}],\"ovp_section_admission_dates\":[{\"anaFaqId\":170200290,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_admission_dates\",\"questionId\":7793109,\"answerId\":7793113,\"questionText\":\"What GATE score is required for M.Tech admission at IIT Kanpur?\",\"answerText\":\"<p>As per the details collated from various sources on the internet, a student must have a GATE rank up to 200 or below for admission to M.Tech at IIT Kanpur.&nbsp; While there is no minimum GATE score for IIT admission, the minimum rank/ score requirement depends completely on the individual institutes participating in the admission process. However, keeping the past cut off trends in mind, candidates must score a GATE rank of up to or below 200 and their minimum GATE score must be between 400-800.&nbsp;The closing ranks of GATE COAP 2022 for the General All India category are as follows:</p><table border=\\\"1\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\"><tbody><tr><th valign=\\\"top\\\" width=\\\"49%\\\"><p><strong>Course</strong></p></th><th valign=\\\"top\\\" width=\\\"50%\\\"><p><strong>COAP Round 9 score (General-All India) 2022</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td valign=\\\"top\\\" width=\\\"49%\\\"><p><a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-m-tech-in-microelectronics-and-vlsi-292888\\\">Microelectronics and VLSI</a></p></td><td valign=\\\"top\\\" width=\\\"50%\\\"><p>717</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\\\"top\\\" width=\\\"49%\\\"><p><a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-m-tech-in-control-and-automation-292968\\\">Control and Automation</a></p></td><td valign=\\\"top\\\" width=\\\"50%\\\"><p>678</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\\\"top\\\" width=\\\"49%\\\"><p><a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-m-tech-in-power-engineering-292997\\\">Power Engineering</a></p></td><td valign=\\\"top\\\" width=\\\"50%\\\"><p>650</p></td></tr></tbody></table>\",\"order\":0,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/what-gate-score-is-required-for-m-tech-admission-at-iit-kanpur-qna-7793109\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":5,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":239498,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2023-09-13T15:00:14\",\"context\":\"Admissions\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":167210458,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_admission_dates\",\"questionId\":7792949,\"answerId\":7792953,\"questionText\":\"How can I get admission in IIT Kanpur for MTech?\",\"answerText\":\"<p>Students who want admission to MTech at IIT Kanpur should have a bachelor's degree in Engineering or Science (4-year course) or must have completed their master's degree in Science with the specified marks. A relaxation of 5% aggregate or 0.5 CPI is offered to reserved category candidates.&nbsp;</p>\",\"order\":1,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/how-can-i-get-admission-in-iit-kanpur-for-mtech-qna-7792949\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":1,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":239518,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2025-10-09T14:46:23\",\"context\":\"Admissions\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":170200292,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_admission_dates\",\"questionId\":7563363,\"answerId\":7563367,\"questionText\":\"Does IIT Kanpur conduct any interview round for MTech admission?\",\"answerText\":\"<p>No, there is no interview round for M.Tech admission at IIT Kanpur. Admission offers for&nbsp;GATE-qualified candidates are displayed on the Common Offer Acceptance Portal (COAP). Students must register at the COAP portal to view and accept their offers. Registration on COAP portal is free. Additionally, candidates are advised to download&nbsp;COAP 2022 information brochure. COAP Registration number is mandatory to apply for M.Tech at IIT Kanpur admission portal. Candidates who have not qualified GATE are communicated directly by the department via e-mail.</p>\",\"order\":2,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/does-iit-kanpur-conduct-any-interview-round-for-mtech-admission-qna-7563363\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":3,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":274450,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2023-06-29T17:02:43\",\"context\":\"Admissions\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":170200294,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_admission_dates\",\"questionId\":10934762,\"answerId\":10934782,\"questionText\":\"Till which date can I fill the choices in JoSAA counselling?\",\"answerText\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\" data-pm-slice=\\\"1 1 [\\\">JoSAA 2027 choice-filling process is yet to begin.</p>\",\"order\":3,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/till-which-date-can-i-fill-the-choices-in-josaa-counselling-qna-10934762\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":5,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":null,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":8,\"dislikesCount\":1,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":2,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-11-23T18:05:07\",\"context\":\"Admissions\",\"isStale\":false}],\"ovp_section_scholarships\":[{\"anaFaqId\":47133600,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_scholarships\",\"questionId\":7563345,\"answerId\":7563347,\"questionText\":\"Does IIT Kanpur offer scholarships to the students? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>&nbsp;IIT Kanpur offers financial assistance to needy and deserving students. Some of the IITK scholarships are as follows:</p><ul><li aria-level=\\\"1\\\">Scholarships from Donors</li><li aria-level=\\\"1\\\">Scholarship for Free Basic Mess</li></ul>\",\"order\":0,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/does-iit-kanpur-offer-scholarships-to-the-students-qna-7563345\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":63,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":240816,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2023-09-15T16:22:56\",\"context\":\"Scholarship\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":124332121,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_scholarships\",\"questionId\":7818869,\"answerId\":7818917,\"questionText\":\"How to apply for IIT Kanpur scholarships? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>IIT Kanpur scholarships are for students who fulfil the eligibility criteria. Those who are eligible can go to the official website to apply. The scholarships are offered in a limited number.</p>\",\"order\":1,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/how-to-apply-for-iit-kanpur-scholarships-qna-7818869\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":61,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":null,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2025-10-09T13:05:00\",\"context\":\"Scholarship\",\"isStale\":false}],\"ovp_section_popular_courses\":[{\"anaFaqId\":124332091,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_popular_courses\",\"questionId\":8734949,\"answerId\":8734951,\"questionText\":\"How many specialisations does IIT Kanpur offer in MTech? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>IIT Kanpur offers the M.Tech programme in 15 specialisations, including Aerospace Engineering, Computer Science &amp; Engineering, Materials Science &amp; Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, Environmental Engineering &amp; Management, Photonics Science &amp; Engineering, Sustainable Energy Engineering and Earth Sciences. All these specialisations together have a total intake of 736 students spread unevenly.</p>\",\"order\":0,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/how-many-specialisations-does-iit-kanpur-offer-in-mtech-qna-8734949\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":11,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":239728,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2023-11-28T13:30:07\",\"context\":\"Courses\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":132581225,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_popular_courses\",\"questionId\":12860871,\"answerId\":12860997,\"questionText\":\"How is the Mechanical Engineering curriculum at IIT Kanpur? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>Mechanical Engineering at IIT Kanpur is a 4-year programme offered in full-time mode. The curriculum covers areas such as applied mathematics, scientific computing, and foundational engineering sciences. IITK offers electives in core areas including Fluid Mechanics, Thermodynamics and Structure and Properties of Materials, Engineering Design and Graphics, and Advanced Mechanics of Solids.</p>\",\"order\":1,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/how-is-the-mechanical-engineering-curriculum-at-iit-kanpur-qna-12860871\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"manual\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":13,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":null,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-06-10T15:18:40\",\"context\":\"Courses\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":164184379,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_popular_courses\",\"questionId\":12843035,\"answerId\":12843069,\"questionText\":\"How is the M.Tech curriculum at IITK? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>The IIT Kanpur M.Tech course curriculum focuses on core areas of:</p><ul><li>Microelectronics and VLSI (MVLSI)</li><li>Power Engineering (PE)</li><li>RF and Microwaves (RF)</li><li>Signal Processing, Communication and Networks (SPCOM)</li><li>Control and Automation (CA)</li><li>Optoelectronics and Optical Communication (OPTEC)</li></ul>\",\"order\":2,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/how-is-the-m-tech-curriculum-at-iitk-qna-12843035\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":13,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":null,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-06-01T16:30:05\",\"context\":\"Courses\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":107195167,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_popular_courses\",\"questionId\":12694339,\"answerId\":12694341,\"questionText\":\"How much does BTech cost in IIT Kanpur? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>IIT Kanpur BTech tuition fee costs around INR 8 L. This fee is exclusive of other components such as examination fee, application fee, hostel fee, security deposit, etc. This fee is taken from the official website. It is subject to change.</p>\",\"order\":3,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/how-much-does-btech-cost-in-iit-kanpur-qna-12694339\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"manual\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":33,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":null,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2026-03-20T15:07:58\",\"context\":\"Fees\",\"isStale\":false}],\"ovp_section_rankings\":[{\"anaFaqId\":42504202,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_rankings\",\"questionId\":7910925,\"answerId\":7910933,\"questionText\":\"What is the NIRF Ranking of IIT Kanpur MBA course? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>NIRF has ranked IIT Kanpur under the 'Management' Category for past three-years. Check below the NIRF rankings:</p><table style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.971%; height: 90.5372px;\\\" border=\\\"1\\\"><colgroup><col style=\\\"width: 49.9659%;\\\"><col style=\\\"width: 49.9659%;\\\"></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\"><th style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\">Year</th><th style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\">Rank</th></tr><tr style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\"><td style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\">2025</td><td style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\">27</td></tr><tr style=\\\"height: 23.3843px;\\\"><td style=\\\"height: 23.3843px;\\\">2022</td><td style=\\\"height: 23.3843px;\\\">29</td></tr><tr style=\\\"height: 22.3843px;\\\"><td>2023</td><td>23</td></tr></tbody></table>\",\"order\":0,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/what-is-the-nirf-ranking-of-iit-kanpur-mba-course-qna-7910925\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":57,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":241262,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2025-09-08T10:02:49\",\"context\":\"Rank\",\"isStale\":false},{\"anaFaqId\":48903808,\"entityId\":25116,\"entityType\":\"institutePage\",\"childPage\":\"overviewPage\",\"wikiIdentifier\":\"ovp_section_rankings\",\"questionId\":7910623,\"answerId\":7910631,\"questionText\":\"What is the rank of IIT Kanpur MBA? \",\"answerText\":\"<p>IIT Kanpur MBA course has been ranked by various ranking Agencies. Check below the 2025 rankings of IIT Kanpur:</p><table style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.971%;\\\" border=\\\"1\\\"><colgroup><col style=\\\"width: 49.9461%;\\\"><col style=\\\"width: 49.9461%;\\\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th>Ranking Body</th><th>Rank (2025)</th></tr><tr><td>NIRF</td><td>27</td></tr></tbody></table>\",\"order\":1,\"answerCount\":1,\"url\":{\"url\":null,\"urlHost\":null,\"absoluteUrl\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/what-is-the-rank-of-iit-kanpur-mba-qna-7910623\"},\"anaFaqSource\":\"asq\",\"generationSource\":\"manual\",\"templateId\":57,\"atfCtrIndex\":0.0,\"showViewOther\":false,\"quesTemplateId\":274466,\"quesBaseCourses\":null,\"isCrawlable\":true,\"likesCount\":0,\"dislikesCount\":0,\"navigationUrl\":null,\"isQuestionHtml\":0,\"experiment\":false,\"messageType\":\"QNA\",\"prepQuestionDetails\":null,\"isAIGenerated\":false,\"alumniFeedbackCount\":null,\"showFeedback\":true,\"answerUpdatedAt\":\"2025-09-08T10:03:39\",\"context\":\"Rank\",\"isStale\":false}]},\"showImagePanning\":false,\"compareRecommendedTuples\":{\"10\":[{\"instituteId\":25116,\"instituteName\":\"IIT Kanpur\",\"instituteUrl\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116\",\"minFees\":800000,\"maxFees\":800000,\"minMedianSalary\":1900000,\"maxMedianSalary\":1940000,\"rankString\":\"#4\",\"rankSourceString\":\"NIRF, 2025\",\"instituteCompareUrl\":\"/compare-iit-kanpur-25116\",\"showFeeDetailsCTA\":true,\"logoUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/1570693266php1HVCm6.jpg\",\"ownership\":\"public\",\"cityName\":\"Kanpur\",\"responseCourseId\":109925},{\"instituteId\":3057,\"instituteName\":\"IIT Roorkee\",\"instituteUrl\":\"/college/iit-roorkee-indian-institute-of-technology-3057\",\"minFees\":800000,\"maxFees\":800000,\"minMedianSalary\":1500000,\"maxMedianSalary\":2658000,\"rankString\":\"#6\",\"rankSourceString\":\"NIRF, 2025\",\"instituteCompareUrl\":\"/compare-iit-kanpur-vs-iit-roorkee-25116-3057\",\"showFeeDetailsCTA\":true,\"logoUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/1570094042phpyJMujv.jpg\",\"ownership\":\"public\",\"cityName\":\"Roorkee\",\"responseCourseId\":110247},{\"instituteId\":2999,\"instituteName\":\"IIT Kharagpur\",\"instituteUrl\":\"/college/iit-kharagpur-indian-institute-of-technology-2999\",\"minFees\":800000,\"maxFees\":800000,\"minMedianSalary\":1400000,\"maxMedianSalary\":1976000,\"rankString\":\"#5\",\"rankSourceString\":\"NIRF, 2025\",\"instituteCompareUrl\":\"/compare-iit-kanpur-vs-iit-kharagpur-25116-2999\",\"showFeeDetailsCTA\":true,\"logoUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/1763553547phpk3rUm5.jpeg\",\"ownership\":\"public\",\"cityName\":\"Kharagpur\",\"responseCourseId\":7978},{\"instituteId\":3011,\"instituteName\":\"IIT BHU\",\"instituteUrl\":\"/college/indian-institute-of-technology-bhu-varanasi-3011\",\"minFees\":800000,\"maxFees\":800000,\"minMedianSalary\":0,\"maxMedianSalary\":0,\"rankString\":\"#10\",\"rankSourceString\":\"NIRF, 2025\",\"instituteCompareUrl\":\"/compare-iit-kanpur-vs-iit-bhu-25116-3011\",\"showFeeDetailsCTA\":true,\"logoUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/1571917722php4T9xSb.jpg\",\"ownership\":\"public\",\"cityName\":\"Varanasi\",\"responseCourseId\":110648},{\"instituteId\":3065,\"instituteName\":\"IIT Guwahati\",\"instituteUrl\":\"/college/iit-guwahati-indian-institute-of-technology-3065\",\"minFees\":800000,\"maxFees\":800000,\"minMedianSalary\":1650000,\"maxMedianSalary\":5100000,\"rankString\":\"#8\",\"rankSourceString\":\"NIRF, 2025\",\"instituteCompareUrl\":\"/compare-iit-kanpur-vs-iit-guwahati-25116-3065\",\"showFeeDetailsCTA\":true,\"logoUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/1631081471php0fdqJ0.jpeg\",\"ownership\":\"public\",\"cityName\":\"Guwahati\",\"responseCourseId\":8427},{\"instituteId\":25425,\"instituteName\":\"NIT Warangal\",\"instituteUrl\":\"/college/nit-warangal-national-institute-of-technology-25425\",\"minFees\":500000,\"maxFees\":500000,\"minMedianSalary\":966000,\"maxMedianSalary\":2440000,\"rankString\":\"#28\",\"rankSourceString\":\"NIRF, 2025\",\"instituteCompareUrl\":\"/compare-iit-kanpur-vs-nit-warangal-25116-25425\",\"showFeeDetailsCTA\":true,\"logoUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/1570182098phpjRtkH9.jpg\",\"ownership\":\"public\",\"cityName\":\"Warangal\",\"responseCourseId\":91276}]},\"whatsNewBacs\":[{\"id\":10,\"name\":\"B.E. / B.Tech\",\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/be-btech-bc\",\"topCourseUrl\":null,\"courseCount\":9,\"feeDetailUrl\":null,\"courseDetails\":null},{\"id\":86,\"name\":\"M.E./M.Tech\",\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/me-mtech-bc\",\"topCourseUrl\":null,\"courseCount\":22,\"feeDetailUrl\":null,\"courseDetails\":null},{\"id\":100,\"name\":\"M.Sc.\",\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/msc-bc\",\"topCourseUrl\":null,\"courseCount\":20,\"feeDetailUrl\":null,\"courseDetails\":null},{\"id\":124,\"name\":\"Ph.D.\",\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/phd-bc\",\"topCourseUrl\":null,\"courseCount\":24,\"feeDetailUrl\":null,\"courseDetails\":null},{\"id\":85,\"name\":\"M.Des\",\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/mdes-bc\",\"topCourseUrl\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-master-of-design-m-des-293489\",\"courseCount\":1,\"feeDetailUrl\":null,\"courseDetails\":null}],\"description\":\"\\n<p><strong>IIT Kanpur admissions 2026</strong> are currently <strong>open</strong> for several courses. A few more updates are given below:</p> <ul> <li>IIT Kanpur has recently<strong> launched 4 new MTech courses</strong>. Admissions to the courses are offered on the basis of <strong>GATE</strong> scores, and are currently <strong>ongoing</strong>.</li> <li>GATE 2027 City allotment notification for admission to the ME/MTech and Phd will be announced on <strong>Jan 4, 2027</strong>. The exam will be held from <strong>Feb 6 to Feb 7, 2027; Feb 13 to Feb 14, 2027; and Feb 20 to Feb 21, 2027</strong>.</li>   <li>IIT JAM 2027 registration process for admission to the MSc course has concluded. The exam will be conducted on <strong>Feb 14, 2027</strong>.</li> <li>CEED 2027 online registrations for admission have been closed. Further exam will be conducted in offline mode on <strong>Jan 17, 2027</strong>.</li><li>JEE Main 2027 session 1 online application form with late fee is now available on the official website for admission till <strong>Nov 26, 2026</strong>. The exam will be held on <strong>Jan 22, 2027 to Jan 24, 2027 and Jan 28, 2027 to Jan 30, 2027</strong> respectively.</li><li>JEE Advanced exam 2027 for admission will be conducted on <strong>May 23, 2027</strong>.</li></ul> \\n\",\"instituteSectionData\":{\"ovp_section_highlights\":{\"description\":\"<p><strong>Indian Institute of Technology Kanpur</strong>, also known as<strong> IIT Kanpur</strong> or <strong>IITK</strong>, is a <strong>public</strong> engineering institute. Approved by the <strong>All India Council for Technical Education</strong> (AICTE), IIT-K was the first-ever Indian institute to offer formal Computer Science education. The institute has an extension centre set up in Noida for outreach activities. Want to take <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/admission\\\"><strong>admission at IIT Kanpur</strong></a>? Check out some of the key highlights below:</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Flagship Course:</strong> <strong>BTech</strong> is IITK's flagship course, offered across multiple specialisations. Popular options include <strong>Computer Science and Engineering, Civil Engineering, and Aerospace Engineering</strong>. Other popular courses at IIT-K are BTech MBA, BS, BTech MTech, BS MS, <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/me-mtech-bc\\\">MTech</a>, MSc, MDes, <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/mba-pgdm-bc\\\">MBA</a>, MS, and <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/phd-bc\\\">PhD</a>.</li>\\n<li><strong>IIT Kanpur fee: </strong>IIT Kanpur fees vary depending on the course you choose. IIT Kanpur fees for 4 years btech is <strong>INR 8 lakh</strong>. Meanwhile, <strong>management program fees</strong> range from <strong>INR 7 Lakh (MBA) to INR 18 Lakh (PGP in Manufacturing for Executives for Visionary Leadership).</strong><span style=\\\"color: #e03e2d;\\\"> <a class=\\\"smce-docs smce-ftype-ico pdf smce-cta-link\\\" title=\\\"IIT Kanpur Fee Structure 2026\\\" data-link=\\\"rd8uSHrTuyEzOSGklqFoV/HgfuSNdsbGyJZerPWBsCwsLucsIJ+84Fz+LylnFSnHYriwth6vFku/LnHyyyj0sAWSzloEhKP753shMTAhHsnvj59ihqT+zf19Pr6czAeGITEzIXKT35ur\\\">IIT Kanpur Fee Structure 2026</a> </span></li>\\n<li><strong>IIT Kanpur admissions</strong> are completely entrance-based. For flagship BTech admission, <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/engineering/jee-main-exam\\\">JEE Main</a> + JEE Advanced + JoSAA is required. As IITK is one of the leading Engineering institutes of the country, the cutoffs go extremely high for all courses, especially for BTech. Whereas, <strong>IITK MTech admission </strong>is through GATE + COAP.</li>\\n<li><strong>Other Accepted Exams: </strong>Other than JEE &amp; GATE, the institute also accepts <strong>CAT, IIT JAM, CSIR NET, UGC NET, JEST, CEED</strong>, and <strong>GMAT </strong>depending on the programmes.</li>\\n<li><strong>IIT Kanpur cutoff 2026:</strong> Cutoff for JEE Advanced <strong>2026</strong> for admission to <strong>BTech</strong> and <strong>BSc</strong> courses has been released. The cut-off ranks varied from <strong>276</strong> to <strong>10552</strong> for the <strong>General AI</strong> category candidates in the first round of admission process. Currently, the toughest branch for admission among all branches is <strong>BTech</strong> CSE with a cutoff of <strong>276</strong> for IIT Kanpur CSE in the general category.</li>\\n<li><strong>Placements:</strong> The Phase I placements at IIT Kanpur for the batch of <strong>2025-26</strong> ended up with more than <strong>250</strong> organizations taking part in the process through campus, virtual, and hybrid formats. A total of <strong>1,202</strong> job offers were made by top companies to students of whom <strong>1,079</strong> offers were accepted (Pre-Placement Offers included). It is noteworthy that <strong>15</strong> students got international offers from firms operating in <strong>Europe, Japan, Korea,</strong> and the <strong>USA.</strong> Major recruiting firms included Accenture, Airbus, American Express, BlackRock, Boeing, Databricks, Deutsche Bank, ICICI Bank, <strong>Mastercard, Meesho,</strong> Navi, PwC, Qualcomm, Samsung, <strong>InMobi,</strong> and <strong>Square Point Capital.</strong></li>\\n<li><strong>Placement of IIT Kanpur MBA Program:</strong> According to IIT Kanpur MBA Summer Placement Report for <strong>2024-26,</strong> the batch witnessed <strong>100%</strong> placements with all <strong>57</strong> students getting internship opportunities from <strong>22</strong> recruiter organizations. In terms of stipend, the highest stipend was of <strong>₹1,70,000</strong> per month, where top <strong>25%</strong> students earned above <strong>₹1,52,000</strong> per month, with an average stipend of INR <strong>93,000</strong> per month and a median stipend of INR <strong>75,000</strong> per month. The top recruiters included organizations like Mastercard, Accenture, ICICI Bank, HDFC Bank, Dell Technologies, RBI, <strong>Amul, Dabur, IndiaMART,</strong> Volvo Eicher, and many more.</li>\\n<li><strong>Scholarships: </strong>IITK offers<strong> merit-based, need-based, and special awards</strong> for meritorious students and financial assistance.</li>\\n<li><strong>Rankings</strong>: NIRF has ranked IITK <strong>5th</strong> in the ‘<strong>Overall</strong>’ and <strong>4th</strong> in the ‘<strong>Engineering</strong>’ category in the <strong>2025</strong> Rankings. While <strong>QS World University Rankings 2027</strong> placed the institute at <strong>221 </strong>position.</li>\\n<li><strong>Notable Alumni: </strong>IIT Kanpur has several acclaimed alumni, including <strong>Ashwini Vaishnaw</strong> (Indian politician &amp; former IAS officer), <strong>Som Mittal</strong> (Indian Business Executive), <strong>Prakash Bare</strong> (Indian Theater &amp; Film Actor), etc.</li>\\n<li><strong>International Collaborations: </strong>IITK has <strong>collaborated</strong> with Imperial College London and Deakin University.</li>\\n<li><strong>Location:</strong> IIT Kanpur campus area in acres is <strong>1,055.</strong> The institute is located on Grand Trunk Road, about 15 km west of Kanpur city, Uttar Pradesh. IIT Kanpur pincode is <strong>208016.</strong></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong><span style=\\\"color: #e03e2d;\\\">Download:</span></strong></p>\\n<p><a class=\\\"smce-docs smce-ftype-ico pdf smce-cta-link\\\" title=\\\"IIT Kanpur MBA Admission Guidelines\\\" data-link=\\\"rd8uSHrTuyEzOSGklqFoV/HgfuSNdsbGyJZerPWBsCwsLucsIJ+84Fz+LylnFSnHYriwth6vFku/LnHyyyj0sAWSzuTMTsCnHheIBTMdG6yf9z3sQbLNyyExMiGBUAeGITEzIXKT35ur\\\">IIT Kanpur MBA Admission Guidelines</a></p>\\n<p><a class=\\\"smce-docs smce-ftype-ico pdf smce-cta-link\\\" title=\\\"IIT Kanpur PG Admission Guidelines\\\" data-link=\\\"rd8uSHrTuyEzOSGklqFoV/HgfuSNdsbGyJZerPWBsCwsLucsIJ+84Fz+LylnFSnHYriwth6vFku/LnHyyyj0sAWSztPBOM/AQnL+t8pxx55g99My2L9eizTseQeGITEzIXKT35ur\\\">IIT Kanpur PG Admission Guidelines</a></p>\",\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_highlights\",\"sectionHeading\":\"IIT Kanpur Highlights 2026\",\"categoryType\":\"ed_and_prod\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":false,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_bac_wise_courses\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_bac_wise_courses\",\"sectionHeading\":\"Popular Courses\",\"categoryType\":\"ed_and_prod\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_fAQs\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_fAQs\",\"sectionHeading\":\"IIT Kanpur FAQs\",\"categoryType\":\"editorial\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":false,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_whats_trending\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_whats_trending\",\"sectionHeading\":\"IIT Kanpur: What's Trending\",\"categoryType\":\"ed_and_prod\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":33842,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_scholarships\":{\"description\":\"<p>IIT Kanpur offers scholarships to meritorious students. The institute offers <strong>Merit-cum-Means</strong>, <strong>Free Basic Mess, INSPIRE- SHE Scholarships,</strong> <strong>Donor Scholarships</strong> and more to its students who meet the specified eligibility required. Students can go to the IIT Kanpur website to know more about the scholarships. Find below the details for some of the <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/scholarships\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">IIT Kanpur scholarships</a>:</p>\\n<table style=\\\"height: 84px; width: 707px;\\\" border=\\\"1\\\">\\n<tbody>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 21px;\\\">\\n<th style=\\\"width: 224.583px; height: 21px;\\\">Scholarship Name</th>\\n<th style=\\\"width: 448.417px; height: 21px;\\\">Scholarship Criteria</th>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 21px;\\\">\\n<td style=\\\"width: 224.583px; height: 21px;\\\">Merit-cum-Means</td>\\n<td style=\\\"width: 448.417px; height: 21px;\\\">INR 1,000 per month is offered to students maintaining a minimum CPI of 6.5.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 21px;\\\">\\n<td style=\\\"width: 224.583px; height: 21px;\\\">Donor Scholarship</td>\\n<td style=\\\"width: 448.417px; height: 21px;\\\">The institute gives Donor Scholarships to meritorious and needy students. 115 scholarships are awarded.</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 21px;\\\">\\n<td style=\\\"width: 224.583px; height: 21px;\\\">Free-Basic Mess Scholarship</td>\\n<td style=\\\"width: 448.417px; height: 21px;\\\">This scholarship can be availed by those who are category (SC/ST) students with an annual parental income less than 4.5 lakhs</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<p>Note: This information is taken from official sources and can change.</p>\",\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_scholarships\",\"sectionHeading\":\"IIT Kanpur Scholarships 2026\",\"categoryType\":\"ed_and_prod\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":false,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_editorial_videos\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_editorial_videos\",\"sectionHeading\":\"IIT Kanpur 2026\",\"categoryType\":\"productized\",\"showToc\":false,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_rcb_mini\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_rcb_mini\",\"sectionHeading\":null,\"categoryType\":\"productized\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_popular_courses\":{\"description\":\"<p>Indian Institute of Technology Kanpur also offers <strong>BTech </strong>as its flagship programme across multiple specialisations in full-time mode for a duration of 4 years. Below are some more details around <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/be-btech-bc\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">IITK BTech</a> course:</p>\\n<p><strong>Specialisations:</strong></p>\\n<table style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 119.556px;\\\" border=\\\"1\\\"><colgroup><col style=\\\"width: 49.939%;\\\"><col style=\\\"width: 49.939%;\\\"></colgroup>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 29.8889px;\\\">\\n<td>Computer Science and Engineering</td>\\n<td><a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-b-tech-in-electrical-engineering-109932\\\">Electrical Engineering</a></td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 29.8889px;\\\">\\n<td><a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-b-tech-in-civil-engineering-73837\\\">Civil Engineering</a></td>\\n<td>Biological Science and Bioengineering</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 29.8889px;\\\">\\n<td>Aerospace Engineering</td>\\n<td>Material Science and Engineering</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 29.8889px;\\\">\\n<td>Chemical Engineering</td>\\n<td><a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-b-tech-in-mechanical-engineering-176829\\\">Mechanical Engineering</a></td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<h3>IIT Kanpur Fees 2026</h3>\\n<p>The fee of IIT Kanpur lies between Rs. <strong>2k</strong> – Rs. <strong>18 lakhs</strong> for the total tuition fee. The total fee varies according to the course and specialization selected. The total fee includes several fee structures such as tuition fee, hostel fee (if applicable), admission fee, and security deposit. The payment can be made either annually or per semester and some components need to be paid only once. The fee structure of IIT Kanpur for four year’s BTech course is Rs. <strong>8 </strong>lakhs. The institute also provides certificate programs for short duration and the fee varies from Rs. <strong>2k</strong> – Rs. <strong>1.45</strong> lakhs. The fee structure for IIT Kanpur Hostel is approximately Rs. 15k per semester.</p>\\n<p>To know more on <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">IIT Kanpur Courses</a> and Fees check the table below:</p>\",\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_popular_courses\",\"sectionHeading\":\"IIT Kanpur Courses & Fees 2026\",\"categoryType\":\"ed_and_prod\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses\",\"isPwa\":true,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":false,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_insights\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_insights\",\"sectionHeading\":\"IIT Kanpur: Insights\",\"categoryType\":\"ed_and_prod\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":31942,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_feedback_widget\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_feedback_widget\",\"sectionHeading\":\"\",\"categoryType\":\"productized\",\"showToc\":false,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_application_process\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_application_process\",\"sectionHeading\":\"Application process\",\"categoryType\":\"editorial\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/admission\",\"isPwa\":true,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_college_comparison\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_college_comparison\",\"sectionHeading\":\"College comparison\",\"categoryType\":\"ed_and_prod\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_polls\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_polls\",\"sectionHeading\":\"Polls\",\"categoryType\":\"productized\",\"showToc\":false,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_reviews\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_reviews\",\"sectionHeading\":\"Student Reviews\",\"categoryType\":\"productized\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/reviews\",\"isPwa\":true,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_results\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_results\",\"sectionHeading\":\"Results\",\"categoryType\":\"editorial\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_notable_alumni\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_notable_alumni\",\"sectionHeading\":\"Notable alumni\",\"categoryType\":\"editorial\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_cutoff\":{\"description\":\"<p>The JEE Advanced 2026 last round (Round 5) cutoff has been released for IIT Kanpur BTech admissions. During the fifth round of admission, the closing ranks ranged from <strong>283</strong> to <strong>7837</strong> for the General AI category candidates. Under IIT Kanpur BTech course, the lowest cutoff rank released for <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-b-tech-in-computer-science-and-engineering-109925\\\">B.Tech. in Computer Science and Engineering</a>, making it the most competitive for admission. IIT Kanpur BTech in Computer Science and Engineering cutoff 2026 stood at <strong>283</strong> in the fifth round for the General category.</p>\\n<h3>Entrance Exams and Cutoff Range (Across All Categories)</h3>\\n<table style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 274.26px;\\\" border=\\\"1\\\"><colgroup><col style=\\\"width: 33.3026%;\\\"><col style=\\\"width: 33.3026%;\\\"><col style=\\\"width: 33.3026%;\\\"></colgroup>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 35.5px;\\\">\\n<th>Course</th>\\n<th>Exam</th>\\n<th>Cutoff Range</th>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 33.25px;\\\">\\n<td><a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/be-btech-bc\\\">BTech</a></td>\\n<td><a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/engineering/jee-advanced-exam\\\">JEE Advanced</a></td>\\n<td>3 - 7,837</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 33.25px;\\\">\\n<td>BS (Earth Science)</td>\\n<td>JEE Advanced</td>\\n<td>72 - 11,668</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 33.25px;\\\">\\n<td>B.S (Stats &amp; Data Science)</td>\\n<td>JEE Advanced</td>\\n<td>207 - 1,409</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 33.25px;\\\">\\n<td>MTech</td>\\n<td><a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/engineering/gate-exam\\\">GATE</a></td>\\n<td>226 - 967</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 33.25px;\\\">\\n<td><a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/msc-bc\\\">MSc</a></td>\\n<td><a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/science/iit-jam-exam\\\">IIT JAM</a></td>\\n<td>21 - 4,990</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 39.25px;\\\">\\n<td><a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/mba-pgdm-bc\\\">MBA</a></td>\\n<td><a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/mba/cat-exam\\\">CAT</a></td>\\n<td>75- 85</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 33.2604px;\\\">\\n<td><a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/mdes-bc\\\">MDes</a></td>\\n<td><a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/design/industrial-product-design/ceed-exam\\\">CEED</a></td>\\n<td>35 - 48</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<h3>IIT Kanpur JEE Advanced Cutoff 2026</h3>\\n<p>Admission to B.Tech, BS, and B.S programmes at IIT Kanpur is based entirely on a candidate's JEE Advanced rank. As per the latest 2026 cutoff (Round 5), the overall closing rank across all categories stood at 3 to 7,837 for B.Tech, 72 to 11,668 for BS, and 207 to 1,409 for B.S.<br>Among the various specialisations, B.Tech Computer Science and Engineering, BS Mathematics and Scientific Computing, and B.S Statistics and Data Science remain the most sought-after choices for JEE Advanced qualifiers in 2026.</p>\\n<table style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 119.556px;\\\" border=\\\"1\\\"><colgroup><col style=\\\"width: 50%;\\\"><col style=\\\"width: 50%;\\\"></colgroup>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 29.8889px;\\\">\\n<th>Course</th>\\n<th>Closing Rank - Round 5 - General AI Category</th>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 29.8889px;\\\">\\n<td>B.Tech Computer Science and Engineering</td>\\n<td>Between 276 and 283</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 29.8889px;\\\">\\n<td>BS Mathematics and Scientific Computing</td>\\n<td>1,258 to 1,270</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 29.8889px;\\\">\\n<td>B.S Statistics and Data Science</td>\\n<td>Between 1,299 and 1,409</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<p>Check detailed <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/cutoff\\\">IIT Kanpur cutoff</a> for various courses below:</p>\",\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_cutoff\",\"sectionHeading\":\"IIT Kanpur Cutoff 2026\",\"categoryType\":\"ed_and_prod\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/cutoff\",\"isPwa\":true,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":false,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_placements\":{\"description\":\"<p>IIT Kanpur has successfully wrapped up Phase I of campus placements for the 2025-26 graduating batch, conducted through a flexible mix of on-campus, virtual, and hybrid hiring modes to maximise accessibility for both recruiters and students.</p>\\n<h2><strong>Key Highlights</strong></h2>\\n<p>The major highlights of <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/placement\\\">IIT Kanpur placements 2026</a> are listed below:</p>\\n<table style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 178.431px;\\\" border=\\\"1\\\"><colgroup><col style=\\\"width: 49.939%;\\\"><col style=\\\"width: 49.939%;\\\"></colgroup>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 35.6806px;\\\">\\n<th>Particulars</th>\\n<th>IIT Kanpur Placement Highlights</th>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 35.6806px;\\\">\\n<td>Organisations participated in Phase I</td>\\n<td>250+</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 35.6806px;\\\">\\n<td>Job offers</td>\\n<td>1,202 </td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 35.6806px;\\\">\\n<td>Accepted offers</td>\\n<td>1,079 (including Pre-Placement Offers).</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 35.7083px;\\\">\\n<td>International offers (Europe, Japan, Korea, and the United States)</td>\\n<td>15 </td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<p>For placement policy 2026-27 of IIT Kanpur, refer to <a class=\\\"smce-docs smce-ftype-ico pdf smce-cta-link\\\" title=\\\"IIT Kanpur Placement Policy 2026-27\\\" data-link=\\\"rd8uSHrTuyEzOSGklqFoV/HgfuSNdsbGyJZerPWBsCwsLucsIJ+84Fz+LylnFSnHYriwth6vFku/LnHyyyj0sAWSzsizHvAmlRP8jH7k5wMms/m+I8TwHEGH9AeGITEzIXKT35ur\\\">IIT Kanpur Placement Policy 2026-27</a> </p>\\n<h2><strong>Top Recruiters</strong></h2>\\n<p>A number of top recruiters from both <strong>domestic</strong> and <strong>overseas</strong> firms participated in the placements at IIT Kanpur, Phase I, namely: Accenture, Airbus, <strong>American Express,</strong> BlackRock, Boeing, Databricks, <strong>Deutsche</strong> Bank, <strong>ICICI</strong> Bank, <strong>Mastercard,</strong> Meesho, Navi, <strong>PwC,</strong> Qualcomm, Samsung, InMobi, and Square Point Capital, amongst others. Some of the PSU firms that participated in the process were <strong>BPCL,</strong> BEL, MIDHANI, and EIL.</p>\\n<h2>IIT Kanpur MBA Placements</h2>\\n<p>The institute has come out with its MBA placements report <strong>2025.</strong> The highest salary package offered during IIT Kanpur MBA placements <strong>2025</strong> was <strong>INR 36 LPA.</strong> The average salary package of the MBA batch <strong>2025</strong> was <strong>INR 17.2 LPA.</strong> The median package was INR <strong>16.5 LPA</strong></p>\\n<p>According to<strong> IIT Kanpur MBA Summer Placements 2024-26 Report</strong>, all the <strong>57</strong> students of the batch have managed to secure internships through <strong>22</strong> recruiters. The highest stipend received is  INR <strong>1.70</strong> lakhs per month while the average and median are INR 93,000 and INR 75,000 respectively. The batch has an <strong>88:12 male-female</strong> ratio and average work experience of 18 months. The most prominent recruiter sectors are IT/Consulting and BFSI. Out of 100 percent of the total, the maximum number of jobs belongs to marketing sector at 33 percent, followed by Analytics at 21 percent and IT/Consulting at 18 percent.</p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: #e03e2d;\\\">Download: <a class=\\\"smce-docs smce-ftype-ico pdf smce-cta-link\\\" title=\\\"IIT Kanpur MBA Placement Report 2026\\\" data-link=\\\"rd8uSHrTuyEzOSGklqFoV/HgfuSNdsbGyJZerPWBsCwsLucsIJ+84Fz+LylnFSnHYriwth6vFku/LnHyyyj0sAWSzn3nb1AlKFodjbFDQ2ZlBOtExLywplj6UgeGITEzIXKT35ur\\\">IIT Kanpur MBA Summer Placement Report 2026</a> </span></p>\",\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_placements\",\"sectionHeading\":\"IIT Kanpur Placements 2026\",\"categoryType\":\"ed_and_prod\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/placement\",\"isPwa\":true,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":false,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_other_popular_GOCs\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_other_popular_GOCs\",\"sectionHeading\":\"\",\"categoryType\":\"productized\",\"showToc\":false,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_affiliated_colleges/departments\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_affiliated_colleges/departments\",\"sectionHeading\":\"Colleges/Departments\",\"categoryType\":\"ed_and_prod\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_about_college\":{\"description\":\"\\n<p><strong>IIT Kanpur admissions 2026</strong> are currently <strong>open</strong> for several courses. A few more updates are given below:</p> <ul> <li>IIT Kanpur has recently<strong> launched 4 new MTech courses</strong>. Admissions to the courses are offered on the basis of <strong>GATE</strong> scores, and are currently <strong>ongoing</strong>.</li> <li>GATE 2027 City allotment notification for admission to the ME/MTech and Phd will be announced on <strong>Jan 4, 2027</strong>. The exam will be held from <strong>Feb 6 to Feb 7, 2027; Feb 13 to Feb 14, 2027; and Feb 20 to Feb 21, 2027</strong>.</li>   <li>IIT JAM 2027 registration process for admission to the MSc course has concluded. The exam will be conducted on <strong>Feb 14, 2027</strong>.</li> <li>CEED 2027 online registrations for admission have been closed. Further exam will be conducted in offline mode on <strong>Jan 17, 2027</strong>.</li><li>JEE Main 2027 session 1 online application form with late fee is now available on the official website for admission till <strong>Nov 26, 2026</strong>. The exam will be held on <strong>Jan 22, 2027 to Jan 24, 2027 and Jan 28, 2027 to Jan 30, 2027</strong> respectively.</li><li>JEE Advanced exam 2027 for admission will be conducted on <strong>May 23, 2027</strong>.</li></ul> \\n\",\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_about_college\",\"sectionHeading\":\"Introduction\",\"categoryType\":null,\"showToc\":false,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":false,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_faculty\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_faculty\",\"sectionHeading\":\"Faculty\",\"categoryType\":\"editorial\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/faculty\",\"isPwa\":true,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_college_counselling\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_college_counselling\",\"sectionHeading\":null,\"categoryType\":\"productized\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_dfp_ada_3_and_4\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_dfp_ada_3_and_4\",\"sectionHeading\":\"\",\"categoryType\":\"productized\",\"showToc\":false,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_reco_widget_1\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_reco_widget_1\",\"sectionHeading\":\"\",\"categoryType\":\"productized\",\"showToc\":false,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_billboard\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_billboard\",\"sectionHeading\":\"\",\"categoryType\":\"productized\",\"showToc\":false,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_infrastructure\":{\"description\":\"<p>The IIT campus at Kanpur is located on a sprawling area of 420 hectares in Kalyanpur and consists of about 108 buildings that are meant to accommodate students in all respects. Besides the teaching blocks, there are different hostels for boys and girls, along with other facilities such as library, canteen, sports ground, auditorium, computer center, and some unique arrangements, including the Liquid Helium facility and Central Cryogenic facility.</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Hostels: </strong>Boys get spacious, well-ventilated rooms, and each hostel comes with its own table tennis room, reading room, computer room, and mess. Girls' hostels are just as comfortable, offering access to indoor and outdoor sports, a reading room, common hall, and mess facilities.</li>\\n<li><strong>Medical Facilities: </strong>There's a proper health centre on campus that takes care of medical needs for students, faculty, and staff alike.</li>\\n<li><strong>Gym:</strong> A modern gym is available on campus for students looking to stay fit.</li>\\n<li><strong>Library:</strong> The <strong>P.K. Kelkar Library</strong> holds a solid collection of books, journals, theses, and periodicals, and it's centrally air-conditioned with a spacious reading area.</li>\\n<li><strong>Sport Facilities:</strong> The sport facilities include basketball, volleyball, football, badminton, table tennis, chess, squash, and cricket. The institute organizes many sports events during the year.</li>\\n<li><strong>IT Infrastructure:</strong> Computer laboratory facility is available on a round the clock basis that has all systems installed in an air conditioned environment along with <strong>UPS support system.</strong></li>\\n<li><strong>Cafeteria:</strong> The food items are prepared hygienically and are provided to students, teaching &amp; non-teaching faculty.</li>\\n<li><strong>Wi-Fi:</strong> The whole college campus is covered with <strong>Wi-Fi facility</strong> including class rooms, hostels and library.</li>\\n<li><strong>Laboratory:</strong> There is separate <strong>CAD lab</strong> in the institution which helps in designing concepts, product development and certification programs and even consultancy for industries.</li>\\n<li><strong>Auditorium:</strong> The institution has many conference halls which have audio visual facility and central air conditioning.</li>\\n</ul>\",\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_infrastructure\",\"sectionHeading\":\"IIT Kanpur Campus & Facilities\",\"categoryType\":\"ed_and_prod\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/infrastructure\",\"isPwa\":true,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":false,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_reco_widget_2\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_reco_widget_2\",\"sectionHeading\":\"\",\"categoryType\":\"productized\",\"showToc\":false,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_ai_overview\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_ai_overview\",\"sectionHeading\":\"\",\"categoryType\":\"productized\",\"showToc\":false,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_dfp_ada_5_and_6\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_dfp_ada_5_and_6\",\"sectionHeading\":\"\",\"categoryType\":\"productized\",\"showToc\":false,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_dfp_ada_1_and_2\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_dfp_ada_1_and_2\",\"sectionHeading\":\"\",\"categoryType\":\"productized\",\"showToc\":false,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_similar_webinar\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_similar_webinar\",\"sectionHeading\":\"\",\"categoryType\":\"productized\",\"showToc\":false,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_online_courses\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_online_courses\",\"sectionHeading\":\"Top online courses you might be interested in\",\"categoryType\":\"ed_and_prod\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_college_counselling_non_paid\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_college_counselling_non_paid\",\"sectionHeading\":\"College Counselling Non Paid\",\"categoryType\":\"productized\",\"showToc\":false,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_comments\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_comments\",\"sectionHeading\":\"Student Forum\",\"categoryType\":\"productized\",\"showToc\":false,\"childPageUrl\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/questions\",\"isPwa\":false,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_admission_dates\":{\"description\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\\\"><strong>Admission to IIT Kanpur</strong> is governed primarily by a candidate's performance in the relevant entrance examination, followed by a structured counselling process. The institute offers admission to a wide range of programmes, including <strong><a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/be-btech-bc\\\">BTech</a>, <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/me-mtech-bc\\\">MTech</a>, <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/mba-pgdm-bc\\\">MBA</a>, <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/msc-bc\\\">MSc</a>, <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/mdes-bc\\\">MDes</a>, MS, and <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses/phd-bc\\\">PhD</a></strong>, each with its own specific eligibility and selection criteria.</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\\\">For <strong>undergraduate admissions</strong>, candidates are selected on the basis of a valid <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/engineering/jee-advanced-exam\\\"><strong>JEE Advanced score</strong></a>. As per the <strong>JoSAA seat matrix for 2026</strong>, IIT Kanpur has a total of <strong>1,210 seats</strong> available across its B.Tech programmes. For those applying to the <strong>MBA programme</strong>, a bachelor's degree in a relevant field from a recognised university is required, while <strong>PhD admissions</strong> call for a master's degree with qualifying marks in the relevant discipline. Candidates applying for <strong>MSc courses</strong> need a valid <strong>JAM score</strong>, and those seeking <strong>MDes admission</strong> are selected on the basis of their <strong>CEED score</strong>.</span></p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: #e03e2d;\\\">Download:</span></p>\\n<p><a class=\\\"smce-docs smce-ftype-ico pdf smce-cta-link\\\" title=\\\"IIT Kanpur PG Admission 2026 Guidelines\\\" data-link=\\\"rd8uSHrTuyEzOSGklqFoV/HgfuSNdsbGyJZerPWBsCwsLucsIJ+84Fz+LylnFSnHYriwth6vFku/LnHyyyj0sAWSzjVY0HybyohNnwjVy3Uc4J0hOSGDT1k3y146B4YhMTMhcpPfm6s=\\\">IIT Kanpur PG Admission 2026 Guidelines</a> </p>\\n<p><a class=\\\"smce-docs smce-ftype-ico pdf smce-cta-link\\\" title=\\\"IIT Kanpur MBA Admission Guidelines 2026\\\" data-link=\\\"rd8uSHrTuyEzOSGklqFoV/HgfuSNdsbGyJZerPWBsCwsLucsIJ+84Fz+LylnFSnHYriwth6vFku/LnHyyyj0sAWSzrv0WTdxLjt0q5nGwFh9F0+3IN7ETWHg0AeGITEzIXKT35ur\\\">IIT Kanpur MBA Admission Guidelines 2026</a> </p>\\n<h3>Eligibility &amp; Selection Criteria</h3>\\n<p>Candidates seeking admission at IIT Kanpur must note that eligibility and selection criteria vary here as per the course. Check out the course-wise eligibility and its selection criteria below:</p>\\n<table style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 239.333px;\\\" border=\\\"1\\\"><colgroup><col style=\\\"width: 33.3026%;\\\"><col style=\\\"width: 33.3026%;\\\"><col style=\\\"width: 33.3026%;\\\"></colgroup>\\n<tbody>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 31.6667px;\\\">\\n<th>Course</th>\\n<th>Eligibility</th>\\n<th>Selection Criteria</th>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 29.6667px;\\\">\\n<td>BTech/BS</td>\\n<td>10+2</td>\\n<td>JEE Advanced + JoSAA</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 29.6667px;\\\">\\n<td>MTech</td>\\n<td>Bachelor's Degree</td>\\n<td>GATE/Written Test + COAP Counselling</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 29.6667px;\\\">\\n<td>MSc</td>\\n<td>Bachelor's Degree</td>\\n<td>JAM + CCMN</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 29.6667px;\\\">\\n<td>MDes</td>\\n<td>BDes</td>\\n<td>CEED</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 29.6667px;\\\">\\n<td>MBA</td>\\n<td>Bachelor's Degree</td>\\n<td>CAT</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 29.6667px;\\\">\\n<td>MS</td>\\n<td>Bachelor's/Master's Degree</td>\\n<td>GATE/CSIR/JRF/NET/COGJET</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"height: 29.6667px;\\\">\\n<td>PhD</td>\\n<td>Master's Degree</td>\\n<td>Written Test + Interview</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<p><strong>How to Apply for IIT Kanpur Admissions 2026?</strong></p>\\n<p>The application process differs slightly depending on the programme a candidate is applying for:<br><strong>BTech: </strong>Candidates selected through JoSAA counselling need to pay the applicable B.Tech fee and report to the college with the required documents for verification.<br><strong>MTech:</strong> After registering for COAP, candidates must fill out the M.Tech application form on the official website and pay an application fee of ₹500 (General/EWS/OBC/OBC-NCL) or ₹250 (SC/ST/DAP candidates).<br><strong>MBA: </strong>Candidates need to fill out the application form on the official website, pay the applicable fee (₹500 or ₹250, depending on category), and submit the form.<br><strong>MSc: </strong>Candidates allotted seats through CCMN counselling must report to IIT Kanpur along with all required documents for verification.<br><strong>MDes: </strong>After qualifying CEED, candidates need to complete the application form online and pay the applicable fee.<br><strong>MS/PhD:</strong> Candidates must visit the official website, fill out the application form, upload the required documents, and pay the applicable application fee.</p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: #e03e2d;\\\">Check:</span> <a class=\\\"smce-docs smce-ftype-ico pdf smce-cta-link\\\" title=\\\"IIT Kanpur Admission 2026 through Olympiad\\\" data-link=\\\"rd8uSHrTuyEzOSGklqFoV/HgfuSNdsbGyJZerPWBsCwsLucsIJ+84Fz+LylnFSnHYriwth6vFku/LnHyyyj0sAWSzpqst7tkwPPqITMzIb+D86KKTFVExLywplj6UgeGITEzIXKT35ur\\\">IIT Kanpur Admission 2026 through Olympiad</a></p>\\n<p><strong>IIT Kanpur B.Tech Admission Process 2026</strong></p>\\n<p>IIT Kanpur's B.Tech programme is offered across several specialisations, including <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-b-tech-in-electrical-engineering-109932\\\">Electrical Engineering</a>, <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-b-tech-in-mechanical-engineering-176829\\\">Mechanical Engineering</a>, <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-b-tech-in-civil-engineering-73837\\\">Civil Engineering</a>, <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-b-tech-in-aerospace-engineering-109900\\\">Aerospace Engineering</a>, and <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/course-b-tech-in-chemical-engineering-109917\\\">Chemical Engineering</a>, etc. Admission to these programmes follows a fairly structured, step-by-step process:<br>1. Candidates must ensure they meet the eligibility criteria for undergraduate admission at IIT Kanpur.<br>2. They then need to appear for and qualify both JEE Main and JEE Advanced.<br>3. Once results are declared, candidates who meet the required cutoff can go ahead and register for JoSAA counselling.<br>4. During this process, candidates have to list IIT Kanpur as their preferred institute, along with their preferred course choices.<br>5. Those who satisfy the institute's cutoff proceed further in the admission process, with seat allotment based on their entrance exam performance.<br>6. Finally, provisional admission is confirmed once the candidate completes verification of documents and pays the applicable <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/fees\\\">IIT Kanpur fee</a>.</p>\\n<p><strong>IIT Kanpur Admission 2026: Documents Required</strong><br>Candidates seeking <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/admission\\\">admission at IIT-K </a>must keep the following documents ready along with correctly attested copies at the time of admission:<br>• Passport-size photograph<br>• Degree certificate<br>• Class 10 marksheet<br>• Class 12 marksheet<br>• Entrance examination scorecard<br>• Caste certificate (if applicable)</p>\\n<p><span style=\\\"color: #e03e2d;\\\">Check:</span> <a class=\\\"smce-docs smce-ftype-ico pdf smce-cta-link\\\" title=\\\"Financial Assistance to M.Tech./M.Des./MS Students\\\" data-link=\\\"rd8uSHrTuyEzOSGklqFoV/HgfuSNdsbGyJZerPWBsCwsLucsIJ+84Fz+LylnFSnHYriwth6vFku/LnHyyyj0sAWSzl6KD0j1AbY0k4aeXHlfBclXWTZl0G2/9AeGITEzIXKT35ur\\\">Financial Assistance to M.Tech./M.Des./MS Students</a> </p>\\n<div>\\n<p>Candidates can check the <a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/admission\\\">IIT Kanpur admission dates 2026</a> in the table provided below:</p>\\n</div>\",\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_admission_dates\",\"sectionHeading\":\"IIT Kanpur Admission & Application Process 2026\",\"categoryType\":\"ed_and_prod\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/admission\",\"isPwa\":true,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":false,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_others_1\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_others_1\",\"sectionHeading\":\"Additional Details\",\"categoryType\":\"editorial\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_assistant_card\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_assistant_card\",\"sectionHeading\":\"\",\"categoryType\":\"productized\",\"showToc\":false,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_collaboration_and_partnerships\":{\"description\":null,\"sectionName\":\"ovp_section_collaboration_and_partnerships\",\"sectionHeading\":\"Collaboration and partnerships\",\"categoryType\":\"editorial\",\"showToc\":true,\"childPageUrl\":null,\"isPwa\":null,\"entityId\":null,\"uspData\":null,\"h3IdToNameMap\":null,\"h3IdsOrder\":null,\"helpfulCount\":null,\"productized\":true,\"sectionExist\":false,\"customDefaultSectionOrder\":false,\"dynamicOrder\":true,\"hideProductized\":false,\"hideAtf\":false,\"desktopReadMoreLimit\":null,\"mobileReadMoreLimit\":null},\"ovp_section_rankings\":{\"description\":\"<p>IIT Kanpur has consistently been ranked by the NIRF in multiple categories, like overall, engineering, management, law, etc. Also, the institute is ranked by QS World Rankings and many other organisations. While NIRF 2026 report is yet to be released, other leading bodies have already started releasing the latest rankings. Based on QS World Rankings, the institute has gone up a position from 222 in 2026 rankings, to 221 in 2027 rankings.</p>\\n<div class=\\\"photo-widget-full\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"figure\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"photo-widget-full\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"figure\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"photo-widget-full\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"figure\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"photo-widget-full\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"figure\\\">\\n<p>Candidates can check the<a href=\\\"https://www.shiksha.com/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/ranking\\\"> Indian Institute of Technology Kanpur rankings</a> in the table below:</p>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<