            "size": 91615,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"status\":\"success\",\"data\":{\"status\":200,\"pageType\":\"iulp\",\"listingType\":\"institute\",\"admissionData\":{\"admissionDetails\":\"\\n<p><strong>IIT Kanpur admissions 2026</strong> are currently <strong>open</strong> for several courses. A few more updates are given below:</p> <ul><li>IIT Kanpur has recently<strong> launched 4 new MTech courses</strong>. Admissions to the courses are offered on the basis of <strong>GATE</strong> scores.</li><li>GATE 2027 City allotment notification for admission to the ME/MTech and Phd will be announced on <strong>Jan 4, 2027</strong>. The exam will be held from <strong>Feb 6 to Feb 7, 2027</strong>; <strong>Feb 13 to Feb 14, 2027</strong>; and <strong>Feb 20 to Feb 21, 2027</strong>.</li><li>IIT JAM 2027 registration process for admission to the MSc course has concluded. The exam will be conducted on <strong>Feb 14, 2027</strong>.</li><li>The CEED 2027 online registrations for admission have been closed. Further exam will be conducted in offline mode on <strong>Jan 17, 2027</strong>.</li><li>The JEE Main 2027 session 1 online application form with late fee is now available on the official website for admission till <strong>Nov 26, 2026</strong>. The exam will be held on <strong>Jan 22,2027 to Jan 24,2027 and Jan 28, 2027 to Jan 30, 2027</strong> respectively.</li><li>JEE Advanced exam 2027 for admission will be conducted on <strong>May 23, 2027</strong>.</li></ul>\\n\",\"showAdmissionFlag\":true,\"admissionPostedDate\":\"Oct 07, 2026\",\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/admission\",\"pdfUrl\":null,\"examList\":[{\"name\":\"COAP\",\"url\":\"/engineering/coap-counselling\",\"fullName\":\"Common Offer Acceptance Portal (COAP)\",\"year\":2026},{\"name\":\"IIT JAM\",\"url\":\"/science/iit-jam-exam\",\"fullName\":\"Indian Institute of Technology Joint Admission Test for MSc\",\"year\":2027}]},\"cpAndADPinterlinkingWidget\":{\"popular\":[{\"id\":32047,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/iit-placements-know-highest-salary-package-placement-process-blogId-32047\",\"title\":\"IIT Placements 2026: Know Highest Salary Package & Placement Process\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1791376338phpGgA51a_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"Know the highest salary packages and the complete placement procedure of IITs here. The engineering graduates from IITs are placed in the top companies with high salaries. The article gives an idea of the highest salaries provided by the companies. Check this page to know about the salary packages offered to IIT graduates.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-10-07 17:56:07\",\"views\":468594,\"userId\":29781649,\"comments\":1,\"shares\":133,\"discussionTopicId\":5909895,\"tagType\":\"exam\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":13971,\"url\":\"/science/articles/iit-jam-list-of-colleges-accepting-scores-ranks-for-admission-blogId-13971\",\"title\":\"List of Colleges Accepting JAM 2026 Scores for Admission\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1764827778phpK1OIN4_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"The list of colleges accepting the IIT JAM score for admission will be released by IIT Kharagpur and CCMN. Admission will be offered to MSc, MSc (Tech), and PhD programs offered at IITs and result-sharing institutes. Get the IIT JAM admitting institutes and result sharing institutes seat matrix on this page.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-10-19 03:32:12\",\"views\":272885,\"userId\":61302717,\"comments\":161,\"shares\":3,\"discussionTopicId\":4038131,\"tagType\":\"exam\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":24059,\"url\":\"/science/articles/iit-jam-eligibility-criteria-blogId-24059\",\"title\":\"IIT JAM Eligibility Criteria 2027 (OUT): Know Educational Qualification and Age limit\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1768309327phpcKaSHo_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"Interested in pursuing a master's degree/MSc from IIT and NITs? Candidates need to appear in the IIT JAM 2027 examination to get admission to eight MSc degree programmes at IIT and NITs. Know the minimum educational qualification and IIT JAM 2027 age limit criteria that candidates need to meet as part of IIT JAM eligibility criteria 2027.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-10-16 16:58:10\",\"views\":165700,\"userId\":61302717,\"comments\":52,\"shares\":3,\"discussionTopicId\":5771637,\"tagType\":\"exam\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":38841,\"url\":\"/science/articles/top-colleges-offering-integrated-bs-ms-dual-degree-eligibility-admission-process-fees-blogId-38841\",\"title\":\"Top Colleges offering Integrated BS-MS Dual Degree: Eligibility, Admission Process & Fees\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1791956300phpcw8OcN_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"Selecting a course in Science straight after class 12 is one option which needs plenty of discussion and thinking. Is it Mathematics that you excel in? Does Biology interest you? Or do you have a way with Physics? One always ponders over the idea of what course take up after class 12. Read the complete article to know further.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-10-14 11:10:39\",\"views\":55639,\"userId\":109730218,\"comments\":1,\"shares\":52,\"discussionTopicId\":6022405,\"tagType\":\"multi\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":18345,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/which-iit-is-good-for-which-engineering-branch-blogId-18345\",\"title\":\"Which IIT is good for which engineering branch?\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1533038426phpbLBjvI_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"Take a look at the list of IITs that are considered best along with the engineering branches they are known for. The list of best IIT with branch has been compiled basis extensiv