- Indian Institute of Technology\"},\"176829\":{\"rating\":4.5,\"name\":\"B.Tech. in Mechanical Engineering\",\"courseId\":176829,\"count\":36,\"primaryId\":25116,\"primaryName\":\"IIT Kanpur - Indian Institute of Technology\"},\"109950\":{\"rating\":4.3,\"name\":\"M.Sc. in Chemistry\",\"courseId\":109950,\"count\":6,\"primaryId\":25116,\"primaryName\":\"IIT Kanpur - Indian Institute of Technology\"},\"292667\":{\"rating\":5.0,\"name\":\"Discontinued (Jul 2023)-M.Tech. in Hydraulics and Water Resources Engineering\",\"courseId\":292667,\"count\":1,\"primaryId\":25116,\"primaryName\":\"IIT Kanpur - Indian Institute of Technology\"}},\"instituteInfos\":{\"53988\":{\"id\":53988,\"name\":\"IIT Kanpur - Department of Industrial and Management Engineering\",\"rating\":4.7,\"count\":11},\"25116\":{\"id\":25116,\"name\":\"IIT Kanpur - Indian Institute of Technology\",\"rating\":4.6,\"count\":408}},\"reviewIds\":[],\"superTopicIds\":null,\"superTopicToTopicIdsMap\":{\"13\":[19,13,17,58,3,36,28],\"12\":[55,31,49,26],\"15\":[6,54,41,9,22,8,30,24,46],\"10\":[15,187,12,123,25],\"16\":[10,47,33,29,2,45,27],\"4\":[155,157,161,119,185,169,81],\"7\":[151,111,175,73,65,203,127,121],\"2\":[171,137,103,131,44],\"3\":[159,67,113,87,147,193,183,139,191,143,125,197,61,91],\"9\":[101,79,149],\"1\":[165,141,77,95,177,115,59,85,97,199],\"17\":[105,205,71,117,129,195,163,99],\"5\":[107,63,145,167,173,89],\"14\":[43,56,42,40,20,21,7,34,38,51],\"6\":[181,207,135,153,179],\"8\":[93,69],\"11\":[201,83],\"18\":[133]}},\"verifiedCount\":343,\"unverifiedCount\":76,\"sorters\":{\"relevance\":\"Relevance\",\"recency\":\"Recency\",\"yearOfGraduation\":\"Year Of Graduation\",\"highestRating\":\"Highest Rating\",\"lowestRating\":\"Lowest Rating\"},\"sortBy\":\"relevance\",\"reviewSummaryDTO\":{\"summaries\":[{\"sectionName\":\"placements\",\"sentiment\":\"positive\",\"summaryText\":\"Most of the industry giants and upcoming startups come to our college for hiring students in any department like ITC, Google, Microsoft, Opera, Amazon, Oracle, Deutsch Bank, etc.\",\"basedReviewCount\":107},{\"sectionName\":\"placements\",\"sentiment\":\"positive\",\"summaryText\":\"Other than this students get placed in different sectors like finance, data Science and consultancy.\",\"basedReviewCount\":112},{\"sectionName\":\"placements\",\"sentiment\":\"negative\",\"summaryText\":\"There are no placement for M.Sc.  students in our department because only coaching center is offering the job with low salary package, So students are not interested in it.\",\"basedReviewCount\":13},{\"sectionName\":\"infrastructure\",\"sentiment\":\"positive\",\"summaryText\":\"Regarding the hostel, the quality of food is okayish; each hostel has one canteen.\",\"basedReviewCount\":98},{\"sectionName\":\"infrastructure\",\"sentiment\":\"positive\",\"summaryText\":\"State of the art facilities with the very high-speed internet, labs with the best equipment, fully furnished lecture halls, fully equipped sports facilities for all sports.\",\"basedReviewCount\":198},{\"sectionName\":\"faculty\",\"sentiment\":\"positive\",\"summaryText\":\"All the quizzes, assignments, general discussions, conduction of interesting labs every week and of the end semester examination helps in learning a lot.\",\"basedReviewCount\":139},{\"sectionName\":\"faculty\",\"sentiment\":\"positive\",\"summaryText\":\"Teaching quality is very high, and the faculty members are experienced and experts in their domains.\",\"basedReviewCount\":195},{\"sectionName\":\"faculty\",\"sentiment\":\"negative\",\"summaryText\":\"Teachers are highly qualified in IITs but some teachers are not at all interested in teaching they are here only to pursue their research interests.\",\"basedReviewCount\":15},{\"sectionName\":\"other\",\"sentiment\":\"positive\",\"summaryText\":\"Studying in one of the top institutes is an asset to me and it is worth it according to the standards of academics and other opportunities.\",\"basedReviewCount\":92},{\"sectionName\":\"other\",\"sentiment\":\"positive\",\"summaryText\":\"In IIT Kanpur, there are a lot of festivals to enjoy including cultural fest (ANTARAGNI), Technical fest (TECHKRITI), Sports fest (UDGHOSH).\",\"basedReviewCount\":80}],\"sectionNames\":[\"placements\",\"infrastructure\",\"faculty\",\"other\"],\"helpfulCount\":8,\"notHelpfulCount\":0},\"insightsDTO\":{\"insights\":[{\"sectionName\":\"Opportunities\",\"context\":\"Internships and industry projects\",\"insight\":\"Students can work with faculty on research projects\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionName\":\"Opportunities\",\"context\":\"Employment opportunities\",\"insight\":\"Many students started their own start-ups\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionName\":\"Opportunities\",\"context\":\"Higher studies preferences\",\"insight\":\"Both inside India & outside India\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionName\":\"Opportunities\",\"context\":\"Placement support\",\"insight\":\"Organized & proactive placement process\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionName\":\"Opportunities\",\"context\":\"Alumni network\",\"insight\":\"Strong alumni network that help with placement opportunities\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionName\":\"Opportunities\",\"context\":\"Entrepreneurship cell\",\"insight\":\"Very Active and resourceful, college is also involved\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionName\":\"Opportunities\",\"context\":\"Overall feeling of students\",\"insight\":\"Love being in college\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionName\":\"Campus Life\",\"context\":\"Sports facilities\",\"insight\":\"Multiple sports grounds & coaching present\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionName\":\"Campus Life\",\"context\":\"College events\",\"insight\":\"Moderately busy calendar with 1-3 monthly events\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionName\":\"Campus Life\",\"context\":\"Mess food\",\"insight\":\"Mess and Cooking arrangements are Hygienic\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionName\":\"Campus Life\",\"context\":\"Attendance policy\",\"insight\":\"Incomplete attendance invites penalty\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionName\":\"Campus Life\",\"context\":\"Dress code\",\"insight\":\"Students can wear whatever they want\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionName\":\"Campus Life\",\"context\":\"Additional expenses\",\"insight\":\"Books\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionName\":\"Campus Life\",\"context\":\"Consequence of rules violation \",\"insight\":\"Rule breakers are let off with a warning\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionName\":\"Campus Life\",\"context\":\"Outside movement of girl students \",\"insight\":\"Not at all restricted\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionName\":\"College Culture\",\"context\":\"Locational diversity\",\"insight\":\"Majority students from outside state\",\"noOfResponses\":147},{\"sectionName\":\"College Culture\",\"context\":\"Student support services\",\"insight\":\"Designated teachers/student reps are present\",\"noOfResponses\":147},{\"sectionName\":\"College Culture\",\"context\":\"Language used in campus\",\"insight\":\"Mostly English is used on campus\",\"noOfResponses\":147},{\"sectionName\":\"College Culture\",\"context\":\"Support staff language\",\"insight\":\"Not restricted to native language\",\"noOfResponses\":147},{\"sectionName\":\"College Culture\",\"context\":\"Any type of discrimination\",\"insight\":\"Students don't face any discrimination\",\"noOfResponses\":147},{\"sectionName\":\"Academic Life\",\"context\":\"Academic schedule\",\"insight\":\"Moderate schedule with around 5-15 lectures per week\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionName\":\"Academic Life\",\"context\":\"Frequency of exams and tests\",\"insight\":\"Semester\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionName\":\"Academic Life\",\"context\":\"Exam preparation\",\"insight\":\"Answers are application based\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionName\":\"Academic Life\",\"context\":\"Teaching methodology\",\"insight\":\"Text book based lectures along with case study discussions\",\"noOfResponses\":146},{\"sectionNa