            "text": "{\"status\":\"success\",\"data\":{\"status\":200,\"listingId\":25116,\"listingType\":\"institute\",\"listingName\":\"IIT Kanpur - Indian Institute of Technology\",\"seoUrl\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/reviews\",\"domain\":\"national\",\"beaconData\":{\"hierarchy\":[{\"stream_id\":2,\"substream_id\":0,\"specialization_id\":108,\"primary_hierarchy\":1}],\"baseCourseId\":10,\"credential\":{\"id\":9,\"name\":\"Degree\"},\"level\":{\"id\":14,\"name\":\"UG\"},\"deliveryMethod\":{\"id\":33,\"name\":\"Classroom\"},\"educationType\":{\"id\":20,\"name\":\"Full Time\"},\"cityId\":122,\"stateId\":126,\"flagshipCourseId\":109925,\"examIds\":[6244],\"instituteOwnership\":\"Public/Government\",\"instituteListingType\":\"institute\",\"isInstituteClient\":0},\"flagshipCourseId\":109925,\"dfpParams\":{\"streamIds\":[2,11,8,9,1,3,14,10,16],\"baseCourseIds\":[10,86,26,100,193,116,101,124,85,195]},\"countryId\":2,\"mapUrl\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/?q=26.512340,80.232894\",\"sdListingId\":25116,\"listingNameWithCityLocality\":\"IIT Kanpur - Indian Institute of Technology\",\"instituteDisplayName\":\"IIT Kanpur\",\"allCoursesUrl\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/courses\",\"instituteShortNameWithLocation\":\"IIT Kanpur\",\"cpAndADPinterlinkingWidget\":{\"popular\":[{\"id\":32047,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/iit-placements-know-highest-salary-package-placement-process-blogId-32047\",\"title\":\"IIT Placements 2026: Know Highest Salary Package & Placement Process\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1791376338phpGgA51a_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"Know the highest salary packages and the complete placement procedure of IITs here. The engineering graduates from IITs are placed in the top companies with high salaries. The article gives an idea of the highest salaries provided by the companies. Check this page to know about the salary packages offered to IIT graduates.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-10-07 17:56:07\",\"views\":468594,\"userId\":29781649,\"comments\":1,\"shares\":133,\"discussionTopicId\":5909895,\"tagType\":\"exam\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":13971,\"url\":\"/science/articles/iit-jam-list-of-colleges-accepting-scores-ranks-for-admission-blogId-13971\",\"title\":\"List of Colleges Accepting JAM 2026 Scores for Admission\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1764827778phpK1OIN4_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"The list of colleges accepting the IIT JAM score for admission will be released by IIT Kharagpur and CCMN. Admission will be offered to MSc, MSc (Tech), and PhD programs offered at IITs and result-sharing institutes. Get the IIT JAM admitting institutes and result sharing institutes seat matrix on this page.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-10-19 03:32:12\",\"views\":272885,\"userId\":61302717,\"comments\":161,\"shares\":3,\"discussionTopicId\":4038131,\"tagType\":\"exam\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":24059,\"url\":\"/science/articles/iit-jam-eligibility-criteria-blogId-24059\",\"title\":\"IIT JAM Eligibility Criteria 2027 (OUT): Know Educational Qualification and Age limit\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1768309327phpcKaSHo_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"Interested in pursuing a master's degree/MSc from IIT and NITs? Candidates need to appear in the IIT JAM 2027 examination to get admission to eight MSc degree programmes at IIT and NITs. Know the minimum educational qualification and IIT JAM 2027 age limit criteria that candidates need to meet as part of IIT JAM eligibility criteria 2027.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-10-16 16:58:10\",\"views\":165700,\"userId\":61302717,\"comments\":52,\"shares\":3,\"discussionTopicId\":5771637,\"tagType\":\"exam\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":38841,\"url\":\"/science/articles/top-colleges-offering-integrated-bs-ms-dual-degree-eligibility-admission-process-fees-blogId-38841\",\"title\":\"Top Colleges offering Integrated BS-MS Dual Degree: Eligibility, Admission Process & Fees\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1791956300phpcw8OcN_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"Selecting a course in Science straight after class 12 is one option which needs plenty of discussion and thinking. Is it Mathematics that you excel in? Does Biology interest you? Or do you have a way with Physics? One always ponders over the idea of what course take up after class 12. Read the complete article to know further.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-10-14 11:10:39\",\"views\":55639,\"userId\":109730218,\"comments\":1,\"shares\":52,\"discussionTopicId\":6022405,\"tagType\":\"multi\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":18345,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/which-iit-is-good-for-which-engineering-branch-blogId-18345\",\"title\":\"Which IIT is good for which engineering branch?\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1533038426phpbLBjvI_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"Take a look at the list of IITs that are considered best along with the engineering branches they are known for. The list of best IIT with branch has been compiled basis extensive analysis of students choices, opening and closing cutoff ranks and other factors. Read more on Shiksha.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-10-13 18:32:24\",\"views\":52069,\"userId\":7679100,\"comments\":5,\"shares\":14,\"discussionTopicId\":4982549,\"tagType\":\"multi\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":0,\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/cutoff\",\"title\":\"IIT Kanpur Cutoff 2026: Check JEE Advanced Round Wise Closing Ranks\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/1570693266php1HVCm6.jpg\",\"summary\":\"IIT Kanpur cutoff 2026 is available on this page for admission to the BTech, MSc, MTech, and other courses. The cutoff was released based on candidates' performance in several national-level accepting exams, including JEE Advanced, IIT JAM, GATE, etc. IIT Kanpur JEE Advanced cutoff 2026 was released\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-11-17 19:53:00\",\"views\":35849,\"userId\":109142833,\"comments\":0,\"shares\":5,\"discussionTopicId\":-1,\"tagType\":\"cutoff_info\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":241569,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/iits-nirf-ranking-2026-blogId-241569\",\"title\":\"IITs NIRF Ranking 2026: Top IITs in India, Old vs New IIT Comparison, Ranking Parametres and Weightage\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1789131863phpIZ2fow_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"Candidates will be provided here the complete list of IITs NIRF ranking 2026 once NIRF engineering ranking 2026 list is published. Until NIRF 2026 ranking is released, candidates can check here past year IIT NIRF ranking and parameters of ranking. Also check Old IITs vs New IITs NIRF comparison.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-11-11 12:11:54\",\"views\":18492,\"userId\":29781649,\"comments\":0,\"shares\":1,\"discussionTopicId\":12991535,\"tagType\":\"exam\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":221876,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/gate-qualifying-marks-blogId-221876\",\"title\":\"GATE Qualifying Marks 2027: Expected Cutoff Predictions, Past Year's Passing Marks Trends\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1790158371phpSKsSiP_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"IIT Madras will release GATE 2027 qualifying marks for all 30 subjects. Candidates preparing for GATE 2027 exam can check expected GATE cutoff marks, passing marks for CSE, GATE minimum qualifying mark for IITs, IISc, NITs, etc. Read here to know about admission cutoff, GATE 2027 marks vs rank etc.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-11-23 14:08:25\",\"views\":17192,\"userId\":2582250,\"comments\":0,\"shares\":0,\"discussionTopicId\":12596890,\"tagType\":\"exam\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":240815,\"url\":\"/college/articles/national-scholarship-portal-2026-27-list-of-schemes-eligibility-amount-last-date-and-apply-online-blogId-240815\",\"title\":\"National Scholarship Portal 2026-27: List of Schemes, Eligibility, Amount, Last Date and Apply Online\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1788522653php5jVX1s_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"National Scholarship Portal (NSP) is the single online window for Central Government scholarships in India. For the 2026-27 session, 18 schemes are listed across ministries such as Social Justice and Empowerment, Tribal Affairs, Labour and Employment, Home Affairs and Railways.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-09-23 13:20:19\",\"views\":15548,\"userId\":3380451,\"comments\":1,\"shares\":10,\"discussionTopicId\":12984175,\"tagType\":\"multi\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":183572,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/iit-admission-without-jee-advanced-blogId-183572\",\"title\":\"IIT Admission without JEE Advanced: Olympiad Route Explained\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1732874277phpB8wBPh_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"Four IITs offer admission without JEE Advanced and via the International/National Olympiads. These IITs are IIT Madras, IIT Kanpur, IIT Gandhinagar, and IIT Bombay. Know what is eligibility criteria are for admission to these IITs, how to apply, what the selection criteria are and more details in this article.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-11-25 18:14:34\",\"views\":15370,\"userId\":29781649,\"comments\":0,\"shares\":2,\"discussionTopicId\":10684098,\"tagType\":\"exam\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":241587,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/nirf-ranking-2026-release-date-blogId-241587\",\"title\":\"NIRF Ranking 2026 Release Date: Expected Timeline, Parameters, How Rank List is Prepared, Last Year Ranks\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1789185790phpx6dljg_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"NIRF Ranking 2026 Release Date: Students and Institutions across India are closely tracking the NIRF ranking 2026. As of now, the Ministry of Education (MoE), Government of India, has not made any announcement regarding the release of the NIRF ranking. Check the article to understand expected release date, past year?s trends, and other details.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-11-12 12:32:11\",\"views\":3483,\"userId\":2582250,\"comments\":0,\"shares\":0,\"discussionTopicId\":12991787,\"tagType\":\"exam\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":0,\"url\":\"/college/iit-kanpur-indian-institute-of-technology-25116/admission\",\"title\":\"IIT Kanpur Admission 2026: Cutoff, Fees, Eligibility & Selection\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/1570693266php1HVCm6.jpg\",\"summary\":\"IIT Kanpur admissions 2026 are currently open for several courses. A few more updates are given below: IIT Kanpur has recently launched 4 new MTech courses. Admissions to the courses are offered on the basis of GATE scores. GATE 2027 City allotment notification for admission to the ME/MTech and Phd \",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-10-07 11:20:00\",\"views\":2098,\"userId\":109142833,\"comments\":0,\"shares\":3,\"discussionTopicId\":-1,\"tagType\":\"admission_info\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":28413,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/jee-main-marks-vs-percentile-blogId-28413\",\"title\":\"JEE Main 2026 Marks vs Percentile vs Rank (Detailed Analysis): Calculate Percentile & Rank Using Marks\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1770479313php00tAqo_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"The candidates planning to appear for JEE Main 2027 must definitely check the JEE Main marks vs percentile vs ranks analysis for 2026. It is important because raw marks do not determine college admission. NTA uses a normalisation process across multiple shifts, turning raw marks into a percentile, which then decides the final AIR.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-11-24 18:43:09\",\"views\":5984600,\"userId\":34019423,\"comments\":0,\"shares\":944,\"discussionTopicId\":5852191,\"tagType\":\"exam\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":20003,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/nits-in-india-blogId-20003\",\"title\":\"List of NIT Colleges in India 2026 - NIRF Ranking, Courses, Seats, Cutoff, Fees and Placement\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1579416701phpg320u6_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"National Institute of Technology (NITs) are premier engineering colleges in India offering admission to degree courses at both undergraduate and postgraduate level. Check here the list of top NITs with their MHRD-NIRF rankings, courses offered, total seat intake and cut offs.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-10-07 17:37:31\",\"views\":3785670,\"userId\":29781649,\"comments\":205,\"shares\":313,\"discussionTopicId\":5232713,\"tagType\":\"exam\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":12884,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/iits-in-india-blogId-12884\",\"title\":\"List of All IITs in India 2026: NIRF Ranking, Courses, Seats, Fees & Placement\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1790858911phpg7jwqe_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"Check list of top IITs in India 2026 with latest NIRF ranking. Also check course, fees and total seats details for all IITs. Eight of the 23 IITs feature in the Top 10 of the NIRF engineering ranking. Get detailed ranking about about old IITs; IIT Kharagpur, IIT Bombay, IIT Madras, IIT Kanpur, IIT Delhi, IIT Guwahati, IIT Roorkee and new IITs.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-10-01 18:41:50\",\"views\":2668421,\"userId\":29781649,\"comments\":41,\"shares\":464,\"discussionTopicId\":3725168,\"tagType\":\"multi\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":44841,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/jee-main-chapter-wise-weightage-blogId-44841\",\"title\":\"JEE Main Chapter Wise Weightage 2027: Past 5 Year Papers Detailed Analysis, High-weightage Topics, Download PDF\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1792127883phpzyHYmF_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"JEE Main PYQ chapter-wise weightage for Physics, Chemistry and Mathematics is available here. It will help students know the topics that have high weightage and are asked regularly in JEE Main. It is advised that students pay special attention to the weightage of chapters in JEE Mains to score good marks in the exam.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-11-18 13:49:51\",\"views\":2312416,\"userId\":34019423,\"comments\":20,\"shares\":725,\"discussionTopicId\":6125641,\"tagType\":\"exam\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":19997,\"url\":\"/engineering/articles/iiits-in-india-blogId-19997\",\"title\":\"List of IIITs in India 2026: NIRF Ranking, Courses offered, seats & cut offs\",\"subTitle\":null,\"homepageImageUrl\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/images/articles/1549963873phpisu5RQ_b.jpeg\",\"summary\":\"Currently, there are 25 IIITs in India, of which 5 are listed as Institutes of National Importance while 20 are set up under the PPP model. Take a look at the list of IIITs in India, courses and seat intakes.  The IIITs in India focuses mainly on Information Technology courses.\",\"lastModifiedDate\":\"2026-09-23 19:02:27\",\"views\":1484944,\"userId\":29781649,\"comments\":188,\"shares\":296,\"discussionTopicId\":5229189,\"tagType\":\"exam\",\"liveBlogStartDate\":null,\"liveBlogEndDate\":null},{\"id\":116905,\"url\":\"/board