          "content": {
            "size": 11234,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"status\":\"success\",\"data\":{\"totalNumber\":492,\"listingType\":\"institute\",\"questionsDetail\":{\"12860999\":[{\"answerId\":12861035,\"answerText\":\"<p>BTech CSE is the most sought after BTech specialisation at IIT Kanpur. The course is offered in full-time mode for a span of 4 years. BTech CSE students at IITK have bagged excellent placement packages over the years. In 2024, the vaerage package for BTech CSE stood at INR 52.8 LPA. </p><p>Further, the course curriculum offers a strong foundation in Science and maths in the first 2 years, followed by highly advanced professional courses and electives in the last 2 years of the course. It is also the most competitve BTech branch with a closing cutoff rank of 271 in 2025.</p>\",\"activityTime\":\"5 months ago\",\"answerOwnerUserId\":84134530,\"questionId\":12860999,\"discussionId\":null,\"aboutMe\":null,\"commentCount\":1,\"msgCount\":1,\"viewCount\":5,\"status\":\"LIVE\",\"userId\":84134530,\"firstname\":\"Tanu\",\"lastname\":\"Rao\",\"creationDate\":\"2026-06-10 15:19:19\",\"url\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/how-is-btech-in-cse-at-iit-kanpur-qna-12860999\",\"title\":\"How is BTech in CSE at IIT Kanpur? \",\"answerOwnerName\":\"Tanu Rao\",\"answerOwnerLevel\":\"Contributor-Level 10\",\"answerOwnerImage\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/reviewDocument/images/1742358753833Image.jpg\",\"likeCount\":0,\"dislikeCount\":0,\"threadStatus\":null,\"answerCount\":1,\"questionCreationDate\":\"5 months ago\",\"hasUserVotedUp\":false,\"hasUserVotedDown\":false,\"isUserFollowing\":false,\"hasUserAnswered\":false,\"type\":\"Q\",\"uniqueId\":null,\"followerCount\":0,\"tags\":[{\"tagId\":192347,\"tagName\":\"IIT Kanpur - Indian Institute of Technology\",\"tagType\":\"Colleges\"},{\"tagId\":388687,\"tagName\":\"B.Tech Computer Science and Engineering\",\"tagType\":\"Course specializations\"}]}],\"12843035\":[{\"answerId\":12843069,\"answerText\":\"<p>The IIT Kanpur M.Tech course curriculum focuses on core areas of:</p><ul><li>Microelectronics and VLSI (MVLSI)</li><li>Power Engineering (PE)</li><li>RF and Microwaves (RF)</li><li>Signal Processing, Communication and Networks (SPCOM)</li><li>Control and Automation (CA)</li><li>Optoelectronics and Optical Communication (OPTEC)</li></ul>\",\"activityTime\":\"5 months ago\",\"answerOwnerUserId\":84134530,\"questionId\":12843035,\"discussionId\":null,\"aboutMe\":null,\"commentCount\":1,\"msgCount\":1,\"viewCount\":4,\"status\":\"LIVE\",\"userId\":84134530,\"firstname\":\"Tanu\",\"lastname\":\"Rao\",\"creationDate\":\"2026-06-01 16:21:39\",\"url\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/how-is-the-m-tech-curriculum-at-iitk-qna-12843035\",\"title\":\"How is the M.Tech curriculum at IITK? \",\"answerOwnerName\":\"Tanu Rao\",\"answerOwnerLevel\":\"Contributor-Level 10\",\"answerOwnerImage\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/reviewDocument/images/1742358753833Image.jpg\",\"likeCount\":0,\"dislikeCount\":0,\"threadStatus\":null,\"answerCount\":1,\"questionCreationDate\":\"5 months ago\",\"hasUserVotedUp\":false,\"hasUserVotedDown\":false,\"isUserFollowing\":false,\"hasUserAnswered\":false,\"type\":\"Q\",\"uniqueId\":null,\"followerCount\":0,\"tags\":[{\"tagId\":192347,\"tagName\":\"IIT Kanpur - Indian Institute of Technology\",\"tagType\":\"Colleges\"},{\"tagId\":414,\"tagName\":\"M.Tech\",\"tagType\":\"Course synonym\"}]}],\"12831371\":[{\"answerId\":12831403,\"answerText\":\"<p>The<strong> IIT Kanpur MSc cutoff 2026 </strong>was published for round 1 for various All India categories, including the OBC category. For this category, the round 1 cutoff ranged from <strong>155 </strong>to <strong>1134</strong>, wherein<strong> M.Sc. in Statistics </strong>was the most sought-after course. </p><p> Students can refer to the table below to know the<strong> IIT Kanpur cutoff 2026</strong> for various branches, listed from most to least competitive. </p><table style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99.9795%; height: 195.889px;\\\" border=\\\"1\\\"><colgroup><col style=\\\"width: 59.6006%;\\\"><col style=\\\"width: 40.3815%;\\\"></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\\\"height: 16.7778px;\\\"><th style=\\\"height: 16.7778px;\\\">Course</th><th style=\\\"height: 16.7778px;\\\"><strong>IIT Kanpur cutoff 2026</strong></th></tr><tr style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\"><td style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\" width=\\\"355\\\" height=\\\"19\\\">M.Sc. in Statistics</td><td style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\" align=\\\"right\\\" width=\\\"64\\\">155</td></tr><tr style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\"><td style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\" height=\\\"19\\\">M.Sc. in Economics</td><td style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\" align=\\\"right\\\">202</td></tr><tr style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\"><td style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\" height=\\\"19\\\">M.Sc. in Physics</td><td style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\" align=\\\"right\\\">203</td></tr><tr style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\"><td style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\" height=\\\"19\\\">M.Sc. in Chemistry</td><td style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\" align=\\\"right\\\">279</td></tr><tr style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\"><td style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\" height=\\\"19\\\">M.Sc. in Mathematics</td><td style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\" align=\\\"right\\\">338</td></tr><tr style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\"><td style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\" height=\\\"19\\\">M.Sc.+ Ph.D. in Physics</td><td style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\" align=\\\"right\\\">417</td></tr><tr style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\"><td style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\" height=\\\"19\\\">M.Sc.+ Ph.D. in Chemistry</td><td style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\" align=\\\"right\\\">504</td></tr><tr style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\"><td style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\" height=\\\"19\\\">Integrated Ph.D. in Sustainable Energy Engineering</td><td style=\\\"height: 22.3889px;\\\" align=\\\"right\\\">1134</td></tr></tbody></table><p> </p>\",\"activityTime\":\"6 months ago\",\"answerOwnerUserId\":97214830,\"questionId\":12831371,\"discussionId\":null,\"aboutMe\":null,\"commentCount\":1,\"msgCount\":1,\"viewCount\":8,\"status\":\"LIVE\",\"userId\":97214830,\"firstname\":\"Neerja Rohatgi\",\"lastname\":null,\"creationDate\":\"2026-05-26 13:26:33\",\"url\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/what-is-the-iit-kanpur-msc-cutoff-for-obc-qna-12831371\",\"title\":\"What is the IIT Kanpur MSc cutoff for OBC? \",\"answerOwnerName\":\"Neerja Rohatgi \",\"answerOwnerLevel\":\"Contributor-Level 10\",\"answerOwnerImage\":\"\",\"likeCount\":0,\"dislikeCount\":0,\"threadStatus\":null,\"answerCount\":1,\"questionCreationDate\":\"6 months ago\",\"hasUserVotedUp\":false,\"hasUserVotedDown\":false,\"isUserFollowing\":false,\"hasUserAnswered\":false,\"type\":\"Q\",\"uniqueId\":null,\"followerCount\":0,\"tags\":[{\"tagId\":192347,\"tagName\":\"IIT Kanpur - Indian Institute of Technology\",\"tagType\":\"Colleges\"},{\"tagId\":408,\"tagName\":\"M.Sc\",\"tagType\":\"Course synonym\"}]}],\"11423844\":[{\"answerId\":12758051,\"answerText\":\"<div><div data-turn-id-container=\\\"request-69d50ffd-a04c-83a6-8787-cfcb4e9aed40-6\\\" data-is-intersecting=\\\"true\\\"><section dir=\\\"auto\\\" data-turn-id=\\\"request-69d50ffd-a04c-83a6-8787-cfcb4e9aed40-6\\\" data-testid=\\\"conversation-turn-176\\\" data-scroll-anchor=\\\"true\\\" data-turn=\\\"assistant\\\"><div><div><div><div dir=\\\"auto\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\" data-message-author-role=\\\"assistant\\\" data-message-id=\\\"43c2a958-fb70-4c43-8f27-c4a0f1815a83\\\" data-message-model-slug=\\\"gpt-5-3\\\" data-turn-start-message=\\\"true\\\"><div><div><p data-start=\\\"0\\\" data-end=\\\"257\\\">At Lovely Professional University, admission to B.Tech Electrical Engineering is not based on a fixed rank cutoff like many government colleges. LPU mainly considers your performance in LPUNEST, JEE Main, or your 12th marks, along with eligibility criteria.</p><p data-start=\\\"259\\\" data-end=\\\"522\\\">So if you are talking about a rank like 2370, it doesn't directly decide your admission at LPU. Instead, what matters is whether you meet the basic eligibility, which is usually around 60% in 12th with PCM, and how you perform in LPUNEST if you choose that route.</p><p data-start=\\\"524\\\" data-end=\\\"828\\\">With a decent academic background or entrance performance, getting Electrical Engineering at LPU is generally not very difficult because the intake is flexible compared to highly competitive colleges. In fact, such a rank can even help you get a good scholarship if it is from a recognised entrance exam.</p><p data-start=\\\"830\\\" data-end=\\\"1005\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\">So overall, yes, you can easily get B.Tech in Electrical Engineering at LPU if you meet the eligibility, and your rank can also help in reducing your fee through scholarships.</p></div></div></div></div><div><div tabindex=\\\"-1\\\" role=\\\"group\\\" aria-label=\\\"Response actions\\\"> </div></div><div><div> </div></div></div></div></section></div></div>\",\"activityTime\":\"7 months ago\",\"answerOwnerUserId\":77038745,\"questionId\":11423844,\"discussionId\":null,\"aboutMe\":null,\"commentCount\":1,\"msgCount\":1,\"viewCount\":19,\"status\":\"LIVE\",\"userId\":47250451,\"firstname\":\"Ritu\",\"lastname\":null,\"creationDate\":\"2025-06-03 00:12:46\",\"url\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/can-i-get-b-tech-in-electrical-engineering-with-2370-rank-qna-11423844\",\"title\":\"Can I get B.Tech in Electrical Engineering with 2370 rank?\",\"answerOwnerName\":\"Vridhi \",\"answerOwnerLevel\":\"Contributor-Level 7\",\"answerOwnerImage\":\"\",\"likeCount\":0,\"dislikeCount\":0,\"threadStatus\":null,\"answerCount\":1,\"questionCreationDate\":\"a year ago\",\"hasUserVotedUp\":false,\"hasUserVotedDown\":false,\"isUserFollowing\":false,\"hasUserAnswered\":false,\"type\":\"Q\",\"uniqueId\":null,\"followerCount\":0,\"tags\":[{\"tagId\":192347,\"tagName\":\"IIT Kanpur - Indian Institute of Technology\",\"tagType\":\"Colleges\"},{\"tagId\":313537,\"tagName\":\"IIT Kanpur - Indian Institute of Technology Admission chances\",\"tagType\":\"Colleges varients\"}]}],\"12842799\":[{\"answerId\":12842989,\"answerText\":\"<p>IIT Kanpur or IITK is considered one of the eminent engineering institutions of the country. The pros of IITK are enlisted below:</p><ul><li>High-quality academics</li><li>Excellent placements</li><li>Research opportunities</li><li>Flexible curriculum</li><li>Distinguished faculty</li><li>Well-equipped infrastructure</li><li>Emphasis on innovation and entrepreneurship.</li><li>Vibrant student life because of the student clubs, sports facilities, and cultural events</li></ul><p>In conclusion, IIT Kanpur is a perfect choice for academically inclined and ambitious candidates.</p>\",\"activityTime\":\"5 months ago\",\"answerOwnerUserId\":84134530,\"questionId\":12842799,\"discussionId\":null,\"aboutMe\":null,\"commentCount\":1,\"msgCount\":1,\"viewCount\":5,\"status\":\"LIVE\",\"userId\":84134530,\"firstname\":\"Tanu\",\"lastname\":\"Rao\",\"creationDate\":\"2026-06-01 15:24:01\",\"url\":\"https://ask.shiksha.com/why-choose-iit-kanpur-qna-12842799\",\"title\":\"Why choose IIT Kanpur? \",\"answerOwnerName\":\"Tanu Rao\",\"answerOwnerLevel\":\"Contributor-Level 10\",\"answerOwnerImage\":\"https://images.shiksha.com/mediadata/reviewDocument/images/1742358753833Image.jpg\",\"likeCount\":0,\"dislikeCount\":0,\"threadStatus\":null,\"answerCount\":1,\"questionCreationDate\":\"5 months ago\",\"hasUserVotedUp\":false,\"hasUserVotedDown\":false,\"isUserFollowing\":false,\"hasUserAnswered\":false,\"type\":\"Q\",\"uniqueId\":null,\"followerCount\":0,\"tags\":[{\"tagId\":192347,\"tagName\":\"IIT Kanpur - Indian Institute of Technology\",\"tagType\":\"Colleges\"},{\"tagId\":187336,\"tagName\":\"Colleges in Kanpur\",\"tagType\":\"Colleges In location\"}]}]},\"allQuestionURL\":\"https://shiksha.com/questions\",\"questionOrder\":[12860999,12842799,12843035,11423844,12831371],\"pageSize\":5,\"maxPagetoDisplay\":2,\"anaFaqData\":null,\"prepFaqData\":null,\"anaWidgetPresent\":false},\"message\":null,\"softUpgrade\":null,\"forceUpgrade\":null,\"shortListCount\":0,\"notificationCount\":0,\"site\":\"\",\"partialResponse\":false}"
